window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a420-78050feb12a90f59.json"]={sha256:"78050feb12a90f59de42020a6a59b827c77fc84a91a700a1efbfc4edf8e48ec6",value:{"id":"a420","title":"數位微鏡光學引擎","titleEn":"Digital-micromirror optical engines","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"以 0.65 吋 1080p、7.56 µm 間距、±12° 傾角的數位微鏡元件為核心，推導照明 f 數與傾角的關係、微鏡陣列的繞射級位置與光展量上限，說明積分柱、TIR 稜鏡與投影鏡頭的設計規則，再以亮度鏈、對比、均勻度與圖樣時序的量測完成光學引擎的誤差預算與交接。","summaryEn":"Built around a 0.65-inch 1080p digital micromirror device with 7.56 µm pitch and ±12° tilt, the course derives the illumination f-number from tilt angle, the diffraction-order positions and étendue ceiling of the mirror array, states the design rules of integrator rods, TIR prisms and projection lenses, and closes the engine's error budget and handoff through measurements of the luminous-flux chain, contrast, uniformity and pattern timing.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-modulation-holography","subcategoryTitle":"光調制、顯示與全像","subcategoryTitleEn":"Light modulation, displays and holography","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-modulation-holography","learningTags":["optics","optics-modulation-holography","modulator"],"architectureFamily":"modulator","architectureNodes":[["光源：LED 或雷射","Light source: LED or laser"],["積分柱與中繼照明","Integrator rod and relay illumination"],["TIR 稜鏡","TIR prism"],["DMD 微鏡陣列與控制器","DMD micromirror array and controller"],["投影鏡頭與像面","Projection lens and image plane"],["光度與時序量測","Photometric and timing metrology"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[2,4],[3,5],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"modulator","labels":["光源：LED 或雷射","積分柱與中繼照明","TIR 稜鏡","DMD 微鏡陣列與控制器","投影鏡頭與像面"],"labelsEn":["Light source: LED or laser","Integrator rod and relay illumination","TIR prism","DMD micromirror array and controller","Projection lens and image plane"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"設計練習：以 0.65 吋 1080p、7.56 µm、±12° 的 DMD 建一台 405 nm 光固化列印引擎。f/# = 1/(2·sin12°) ≈ 2.4，物方 NA = 0.208。有效面積 14.5×8.16 ≈ 118 mm²，光展量 G = 118×π×sin²12° ≈ 16.0 mm²·sr；2×2 mm 朗伯 LED 的 12.6 mm²·sr 可完整耦合。積分柱出口 3.6×2.0 mm，放大 4.0 倍，柱內玻璃中錐角 33.7°，20 mm 長每軸反射 ≈ 3.7 次。亮度鏈：1500 lm × 0.70 × 0.90 × 0.90 × 0.95 × 0.92 × 0.88 × 0.86 × 0.90 ≈ 506 lm。像面像素 50 µm 需 M = 6.6，像方 NA 0.0315，繞射光斑 15.7 µm，景深 ±204 µm，像面寬 96 mm。熱：吸收 0.8 W 加電功率 1.5 W，熱阻 9.2 K/W，溫升 21 K。固化深度 C_d = D_p·ln(E/E_c)，D_p = 100 µm、E = 4E_c 得 139 µm，照度 +10% 多固化 9.5 µm，故均勻度規格取 ±5%。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Design exercise: build a 405 nm photopolymer printing engine on a 0.65-inch 1080p DMD with 7.56 µm pitch and ±12° tilt. f/# = 1/(2·sin12°) ≈ 2.4, object-side NA = 0.208. Active area 14.5×8.16 ≈ 118 mm² gives étendue G = 118×π×sin²12° ≈ 16.0 mm²·sr; a 2×2 mm Lambertian LED with 12.6 mm²·sr couples in full. The integrator rod exit is 3.6×2.0 mm, magnified 4.0 times, with a 33.7° cone inside the glass and ≈ 3.7 reflections per axis over 20 mm. Flux chain: 1500 lm × 0.70 × 0.90 × 0.90 × 0.95 × 0.92 × 0.88 × 0.86 × 0.90 ≈ 506 lm. A 50 µm image pixel needs M = 6.6, image-side NA 0.0315, a 15.7 µm diffraction spot, ±204 µm depth of field and a 96 mm wide field. Thermal: 0.8 W absorbed plus 1.5 W electrical through 9.2 K/W gives a 21 K rise. Cure depth C_d = D_p·ln(E/E_c) with D_p = 100 µm and E = 4E_c is 139 µm, and +10% irradiance over-cures by 9.5 µm, so the uniformity specification is set at ±5%. Values are teaching assumptions.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a420-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「微鏡傾角與照明 f 數」與「鏡陣繞射與光展量上限」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Mirror tilt and illumination f-number\" and \"Array diffraction and the étendue ceiling\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a420-v12-01","title":"微鏡傾角與照明 f 數：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Mirror tilt and illumination f-number: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「±12° 微鏡傾角與照明入射角」如何決定數位微鏡光學引擎的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “±12° mirror tilt and illumination incidence” determines the key performance of “Digital-micromirror optical engines”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"數位微鏡元件的每個鋁鏡面繞對角線軸在 +12° 與 −12° 兩個穩態之間切換。照明光以傾角兩倍（24°）的角度射入，開態鏡面把光反射到元件法線方向進入投影鏡頭，關態鏡面則把光反射到法線另一側 48° 處被光吸收器接走，未上電的平態鏡面反射到 24°。要讓三個反射錐彼此不重疊，照明與投影的錐半角都不能超過傾角，這直接決定了引擎的最小 f 數，也決定亮度上限。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「±12° 微鏡傾角與照明入射角」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Each aluminium mirror of a digital micromirror device switches about a diagonal axis between two stable states at +12° and −12°. Illumination arrives at twice the tilt (24°); on-state mirrors send light along the device normal into the projection lens, off-state mirrors send it to 48° on the other side of the normal into a light absorber, and unpowered flat-state mirrors reflect at 24°. For the three reflected cones not to overlap, the half-angles of the illumination and projection cones must not exceed the tilt angle, which fixes the engine's minimum f-number and hence its brightness ceiling. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “±12° mirror tilt and illumination incidence”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：最小 f 數 f/# = 1/(2·sinθ_tilt)：θ_tilt = 12° 時 f/# = 1/(2×0.2079) ≈ 2.4；θ_tilt = 17° 的元件可到 f/1.7，錐立體角大 (sin17°/sin12°)² ≈ 1.98 倍，同樣光源可多收近一倍的光。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The minimum f-number is f/# = 1/(2·sinθ_tilt): for θ_tilt = 12°, f/# = 1/(2×0.2079) ≈ 2.4; a 17° device allows f/1.7 with a cone solid angle larger by (sin17°/sin12°)² ≈ 1.98, nearly doubling the light collected from the same source.","failure":"常見誤解：「微鏡只是一面小鏡子，照明角度可以任意選。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A micromirror is just a tiny mirror, so the illumination angle can be anything.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「±12° 微鏡傾角與照明入射角」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “±12° mirror tilt and illumination incidence”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-01-k1","title":"微鏡傾角與照明 f 數","titleEn":"Mirror tilt and illumination f-number","text":"數位微鏡元件的每個鋁鏡面繞對角線軸在 +12° 與 −12° 兩個穩態之間切換。照明光以傾角兩倍（24°）的角度射入，開態鏡面把光反射到元件法線方向進入投影鏡頭，關態鏡面則把光反射到法線另一側 48° 處被光吸收器接走，未上電的平態鏡面反射到 24°。","textEn":"Each aluminium mirror of a digital micromirror device switches about a diagonal axis between two stable states at +12° and −12°. Illumination arrives at twice the tilt (24°); on-state mirrors send light along the device normal into the projection lens, off-state mirrors send it to 48° on the other side of the normal into a light absorber, and unpowered flat-state mirrors reflect at 24°.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：微鏡只是一面小鏡子，照明角度可以任意選。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A micromirror is just a tiny mirror, so the illumination angle can be anything. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「微鏡傾角與照明 f 數」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Mirror tilt and illumination f-number\" is correct?","options":["微鏡只是一面小鏡子，照明角度可以任意選。","數位微鏡元件的每個鋁鏡面繞對角線軸在 +12° 與 −12° 兩個穩態之間切換。","光源功率越大，投影亮度一定越高。"],"optionsEn":["A micromirror is just a tiny mirror, so the illumination angle can be anything.","Each aluminium mirror of a digital micromirror device switches about a diagonal axis between two stable states at +12° and −12°.","Higher source power always gives a brighter projection."],"answer":1,"explanation":"數位微鏡元件的每個鋁鏡面繞對角線軸在 +12° 與 −12° 兩個穩態之間切換。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Each aluminium mirror of a digital micromirror device switches about a diagonal axis between two stable states at +12° and −12°. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a420-v12-02","title":"微鏡傾角與照明 f 數：定量估算","titleEn":"Mirror tilt and illumination f-number: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「±12° 微鏡傾角與照明入射角」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “±12° mirror tilt and illumination incidence” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：最小 f 數 f/# = 1/(2·sinθ_tilt)：θ_tilt = 12° 時 f/# = 1/(2×0.2079) ≈ 2.4；θ_tilt = 17° 的元件可到 f/1.7，錐立體角大 (sin17°/sin12°)² ≈ 1.98 倍，同樣光源可多收近一倍的光。開態、平態與關態反射方向分別為 0°、24°、48°。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The minimum f-number is f/# = 1/(2·sinθ_tilt): for θ_tilt = 12°, f/# = 1/(2×0.2079) ≈ 2.4; a 17° device allows f/1.7 with a cone solid angle larger by (sin17°/sin12°)² ≈ 1.98, nearly doubling the light collected from the same source. On, flat and off reflections leave at 0°, 24° and 48° respectively. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：把全白圖樣載入元件，用旋轉臂上的光度探頭在法線附近 ±30° 掃描反射光分佈，應看到中心開態主瓣、24° 的平態殘留與 48° 的關態瓣；主瓣半寬與照明 f 數換算的錐角一致，則幾何正確。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Load an all-white pattern and scan the reflected-light distribution within ±30° of the normal with a photometric probe on a rotating arm; the central on-state lobe, a flat-state remnant at 24° and the off-state lobe at 48° should appear, and a main-lobe half-width matching the cone angle implied by the illumination f-number confirms the geometry.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"最小 f 數 f/# = 1/(2·sinθ_tilt)：θ_tilt = 12° 時 f/# = 1/(2×0.2079) ≈ 2.4；θ_tilt = 17° 的元件可到 f/1.7，錐立體角大 (sin17°/sin12°)² ≈ 1.98 倍，同樣光源可多收近一倍的光。開態、平態與關態反射方向分別為 0°、24°、48°。","textEn":"The minimum f-number is f/# = 1/(2·sinθ_tilt): for θ_tilt = 12°, f/# = 1/(2×0.2079) ≈ 2.4; a 17° device allows f/1.7 with a cone solid angle larger by (sin17°/sin12°)² ≈ 1.98, nearly doubling the light collected from the same source. On, flat and off reflections leave at 0°, 24° and 48° respectively.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「微鏡傾角與照明 f 數」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Mirror tilt and illumination f-number\", which statement holds?","options":["積分柱越長均勻度越好，所以長度沒有代價。","鏡面是反射的，所以 DMD 不會吸收光功率、不需要散熱。","最小 f 數 f/# = 1/(2·sinθ_tilt)：θ_tilt = 12° 時 f/# = 1/(2×0.2079) ≈ 2.4。"],"optionsEn":["A longer integrator rod always improves uniformity, so length has no cost.","Mirrors reflect, so a DMD absorbs no optical power and needs no cooling.","The minimum f-number is f/# = 1/(2·sinθ_tilt): for θ_tilt = 12°, f/# = 1/(2×0.2079) ≈ 2.4."],"answer":2,"explanation":"最小 f 數 f/# = 1/(2·sinθ_tilt)：θ_tilt = 12° 時 f/# = 1/(2×0.2079) ≈ 2.4；θ_tilt = 17° 的元件可到 f/1.7，錐立體角大 (sin17°/sin12°)² ≈ 1.98 倍，同樣光源可多收近一倍的光。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The minimum f-number is f/# = 1/(2·sinθ_tilt): for θ_tilt = 12°, f/# = 1/(2×0.2079) ≈ 2.4; a 17° device allows f/1.7 with a cone solid angle larger by (sin17°/sin12°)² ≈ 1.98, nearly doubling the light collected from the same source. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a420-v12-03","title":"微鏡傾角與照明 f 數：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Mirror tilt and illumination f-number: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「±12° 微鏡傾角與照明入射角」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “±12° mirror tilt and illumination incidence” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"把全白圖樣載入元件，用旋轉臂上的光度探頭在法線附近 ±30° 掃描反射光分佈，應看到中心開態主瓣、24° 的平態殘留與 48° 的關態瓣；主瓣半寬與照明 f 數換算的錐角一致，則幾何正確。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Load an all-white pattern and scan the reflected-light distribution within ±30° of the normal with a photometric probe on a rotating arm; the central on-state lobe, a flat-state remnant at 24° and the off-state lobe at 48° should appear, and a main-lobe half-width matching the cone angle implied by the illumination f-number confirms the geometry. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為了提高亮度把照明錐放大到 f/1.8（半角 16°），開態錐與平態錐在 12° 到 16° 之間重疊，黑畫面漏光使對比從 2000:1 掉到 300:1，亮度卻只多了約 70%。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Enlarging the illumination cone to f/1.8 (16° half-angle) for brightness lets the on-state and flat-state cones overlap between 12° and 16°; black-level leakage cuts contrast from 2000:1 to 300:1 while brightness gains only about 70%.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"把全白圖樣載入元件，用旋轉臂上的光度探頭在法線附近 ±30° 掃描反射光分佈，應看到中心開態主瓣、24° 的平態殘留與 48° 的關態瓣；主瓣半寬與照明 f 數換算的錐角一致，則幾何正確。","textEn":"Load an all-white pattern and scan the reflected-light distribution within ±30° of the normal with a photometric probe on a rotating arm; the central on-state lobe, a flat-state remnant at 24° and the off-state lobe at 48° should appear, and a main-lobe half-width matching the cone angle implied by the illumination f-number confirms the geometry.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「微鏡傾角與照明 f 數」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Mirror tilt and illumination f-number\"?","options":["把全白圖樣載入元件，用旋轉臂上的光度探頭在法線附近 ±30° 掃描反射光分佈，應看到中心開態主瓣、24° 的平態殘留與 48° 的關態瓣。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","投影像素尺寸只由 DMD 像素間距決定。"],"optionsEn":["Load an all-white pattern and scan the reflected-light distribution within ±30° of the normal with a photometric probe on a rotating arm.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","The projected pixel size is set by the DMD pitch alone."],"answer":0,"explanation":"把全白圖樣載入元件，用旋轉臂上的光度探頭在法線附近 ±30° 掃描反射光分佈，應看到中心開態主瓣、24° 的平態殘留與 48° 的關態瓣；主瓣半寬與照明 f 數換算的錐角一致，則幾何正確。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Load an all-white pattern and scan the reflected-light distribution within ±30° of the normal with a photometric probe on a rotating arm; the central on-state lobe, a flat-state remnant at 24° and the off-state lobe at 48° should appear, and a main-lobe half-width matching the cone angle implied by the illumination f-number confirms the geometry. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a420-v12-04","title":"微鏡傾角與照明 f 數：失效診斷","titleEn":"Mirror tilt and illumination f-number: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「±12° 微鏡傾角與照明入射角」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “±12° mirror tilt and illumination incidence” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為了提高亮度把照明錐放大到 f/1.8（半角 16°），開態錐與平態錐在 12° 到 16° 之間重疊，黑畫面漏光使對比從 2000:1 掉到 300:1，亮度卻只多了約 70%。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Enlarging the illumination cone to f/1.8 (16° half-angle) for brightness lets the on-state and flat-state cones overlap between 12° and 16°; black-level leakage cuts contrast from 2000:1 to 300:1 while brightness gains only about 70%. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：要讓三個反射錐彼此不重疊，照明與投影的錐半角都不能超過傾角，這直接決定了引擎的最小 f 數，也決定亮度上限。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: For the three reflected cones not to overlap, the half-angles of the illumination and projection cones must not exceed the tilt angle, which fixes the engine's minimum f-number and hence its brightness ceiling.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「微鏡只是一面小鏡子，照明角度可以任意選。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A micromirror is just a tiny mirror, so the illumination angle can be anything.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了提高亮度把照明錐放大到 f/1.8（半角 16°），開態錐與平態錐在 12° 到 16° 之間重疊，黑畫面漏光使對比從 2000:1 掉到 300:1，亮度卻只多了約 70%。","textEn":"Enlarging the illumination cone to f/1.8 (16° half-angle) for brightness lets the on-state and flat-state cones overlap between 12° and 16°; black-level leakage cuts contrast from 2000:1 to 300:1 while brightness gains only about 70%.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「微鏡傾角與照明 f 數」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Mirror tilt and illumination f-number\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","為了提高亮度把照明錐放大到 f/1.8（半角 16°），開態錐與平態錐在 12° 到 16° 之間重疊，黑畫面漏光使對比從 2000:1 掉到 300:1，亮度卻只多了約 70%。","光源功率越大，投影亮度一定越高。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Enlarging the illumination cone to f/1.8 (16° half-angle) for brightness lets the on-state and flat-state cones overlap between 12° and 16°.","Higher source power always gives a brighter projection."],"answer":1,"explanation":"為了提高亮度把照明錐放大到 f/1.8（半角 16°），開態錐與平態錐在 12° 到 16° 之間重疊，黑畫面漏光使對比從 2000:1 掉到 300:1，亮度卻只多了約 70%。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Enlarging the illumination cone to f/1.8 (16° half-angle) for brightness lets the on-state and flat-state cones overlap between 12° and 16°; black-level leakage cuts contrast from 2000:1 to 300:1 while brightness gains only about 70%. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a420-v12-05","title":"鏡陣繞射與光展量上限：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Array diffraction and the étendue ceiling: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「7.56 µm 鏡面格點的繞射級」如何決定數位微鏡光學引擎的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Diffraction orders of the 7.56 µm mirror lattice” determines the key performance of “Digital-micromirror optical engines”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"微鏡陣列本身是一個二維閃耀光柵：週期 7.56 µm 的鏡面格點讓反射光只能存在於離散的繞射級，而傾斜的鏡面像閃耀面一樣決定能量落在哪幾個級。寬頻 LED 照明時各波長的級互相填補，投影錐內看起來連續；用雷射照明時各級變成分立亮點，對比與均勻性都受影響。光展量 G = A·π·sin²θ 由鏡面面積與可接受的錐角決定，光源的光展量一旦超過它，多出的光無論如何都進不了引擎。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「7.56 µm 鏡面格點的繞射級」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The mirror array is itself a two-dimensional blazed grating: the 7.56 µm lattice allows reflected light only in discrete diffraction orders, while the tilted facets act as the blaze that decides which orders carry the energy. Under broadband LED illumination the orders of different wavelengths fill each other in and the projection cone looks continuous; under laser illumination the orders become separate bright spots that affect contrast and uniformity. The étendue G = A·π·sin²θ is fixed by mirror area and acceptance cone, and any source étendue beyond it cannot enter the engine by any means. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Diffraction orders of the 7.56 µm mirror lattice”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：級間角距 λ/p = 0.532/7.56 = 0.0704 rad ≈ 4.03°；入射 24° 時第 m 級方向 sinθ_m = m·0.0704 − 0.4067，m = 6 給 0.89°、m = 5 給 −3.1°，皆在 f/2.4 的 ±12° 錐內。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: The order spacing is λ/p = 0.532/7.56 = 0.0704 rad ≈ 4.03°; at 24° incidence the m-th order lies at sinθ_m = m·0.0704 − 0.4067, giving 0.89° for m = 6 and −3.1° for m = 5, both inside the ±12° cone of f/2.4.","failure":"常見誤解：「光源功率越大，投影亮度一定越高。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Higher source power always gives a brighter projection.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「7.56 µm 鏡面格點的繞射級」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Diffraction orders of the 7.56 µm mirror lattice”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-05-k1","title":"鏡陣繞射與光展量上限","titleEn":"Array diffraction and the étendue ceiling","text":"微鏡陣列本身是一個二維閃耀光柵：週期 7.56 µm 的鏡面格點讓反射光只能存在於離散的繞射級，而傾斜的鏡面像閃耀面一樣決定能量落在哪幾個級。寬頻 LED 照明時各波長的級互相填補，投影錐內看起來連續；用雷射照明時各級變成分立亮點，對比與均勻性都受影響。","textEn":"The mirror array is itself a two-dimensional blazed grating: the 7.56 µm lattice allows reflected light only in discrete diffraction orders, while the tilted facets act as the blaze that decides which orders carry the energy. Under broadband LED illumination the orders of different wavelengths fill each other in and the projection cone looks continuous; under laser illumination the orders become separate bright spots that affect contrast and uniformity.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：光源功率越大，投影亮度一定越高。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Higher source power always gives a brighter projection. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「鏡陣繞射與光展量上限」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Array diffraction and the étendue ceiling\" is correct?","options":["光源功率越大，投影亮度一定越高。","微鏡是類比連續偏轉的，可以停在任意角度。","微鏡陣列本身是一個二維閃耀光柵：週期 7.56 µm 的鏡面格點讓反射光只能存在於離散的繞射級，而傾斜的鏡面像閃耀面一樣決定能量落在哪幾個級。"],"optionsEn":["Higher source power always gives a brighter projection.","Micromirrors deflect continuously and can be held at any angle.","The mirror array is itself a two-dimensional blazed grating: the 7.56 µm lattice allows reflected light only in discrete diffraction orders, while the tilted facets act as the blaze that decides which orders carry the energy."],"answer":2,"explanation":"微鏡陣列本身是一個二維閃耀光柵：週期 7.56 µm 的鏡面格點讓反射光只能存在於離散的繞射級，而傾斜的鏡面像閃耀面一樣決定能量落在哪幾個級。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The mirror array is itself a two-dimensional blazed grating: the 7.56 µm lattice allows reflected light only in discrete diffraction orders, while the tilted facets act as the blaze that decides which orders carry the energy. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a420-v12-06","title":"鏡陣繞射與光展量上限：定量估算","titleEn":"Array diffraction and the étendue ceiling: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「7.56 µm 鏡面格點的繞射級」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Diffraction orders of the 7.56 µm mirror lattice” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：級間角距 λ/p = 0.532/7.56 = 0.0704 rad ≈ 4.03°；入射 24° 時第 m 級方向 sinθ_m = m·0.0704 − 0.4067，m = 6 給 0.89°、m = 5 給 −3.1°，皆在 f/2.4 的 ±12° 錐內。0.65 吋元件有效面積 14.5×8.16 ≈ 118 mm²，G = 118×π×sin²12° ≈ 16.0 mm²·sr；2×2 mm 朗伯 LED 的 G = 4×π ≈ 12.6 mm²·sr，可完整利用。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: The order spacing is λ/p = 0.532/7.56 = 0.0704 rad ≈ 4.03°; at 24° incidence the m-th order lies at sinθ_m = m·0.0704 − 0.4067, giving 0.89° for m = 6 and −3.1° for m = 5, both inside the ±12° cone of f/2.4. The 0.65-inch device has an active area of 14.5×8.16 ≈ 118 mm², so G = 118×π×sin²12° ≈ 16.0 mm²·sr; a 2×2 mm Lambertian LED has G = 4×π ≈ 12.6 mm²·sr and can be used in full. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以 532 nm 雷射擴束照射全白圖樣，在 1 m 處的屏幕上量繞射亮點間距，應為 1 m × tan(4.03°) ≈ 70 mm；再把 LED 換成已知面積與角分佈的光源，量進入投影鏡頭的流明，與光展量比值預測的收集效率比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Illuminate an all-white pattern with an expanded 532 nm laser and measure the spacing of diffraction spots on a screen 1 m away, expected at 1 m × tan(4.03°) ≈ 70 mm; then swap in an LED of known area and angular distribution, measure the lumens entering the projection lens and compare with the collection efficiency predicted by the étendue ratio.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"級間角距 λ/p = 0.532/7.56 = 0.0704 rad ≈ 4.03°；入射 24° 時第 m 級方向 sinθ_m = m·0.0704 − 0.4067，m = 6 給 0.89°、m = 5 給 −3.1°，皆在 f/2.4 的 ±12° 錐內。0.65 吋元件有效面積 14.5×8.16 ≈ 118 mm²，G = 118×π×sin²12° ≈ 16.0 mm²·sr；2×2 mm 朗伯 LED 的 G = 4×π ≈ 12.6 mm²·sr，可完整利用。","textEn":"The order spacing is λ/p = 0.532/7.56 = 0.0704 rad ≈ 4.03°; at 24° incidence the m-th order lies at sinθ_m = m·0.0704 − 0.4067, giving 0.89° for m = 6 and −3.1° for m = 5, both inside the ±12° cone of f/2.4. The 0.65-inch device has an active area of 14.5×8.16 ≈ 118 mm², so G = 118×π×sin²12° ≈ 16.0 mm²·sr; a 2×2 mm Lambertian LED has G = 4×π ≈ 12.6 mm²·sr and can be used in full.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「鏡陣繞射與光展量上限」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Array diffraction and the étendue ceiling\", which statement holds?","options":["級間角距 λ/p = 0.532/7.56 = 0.0704 rad ≈ 4.03°。","流明是光源的屬性，與引擎的 f 數無關。","投影像素尺寸只由 DMD 像素間距決定。"],"optionsEn":["The order spacing is λ/p = 0.532/7.56 = 0.0704 rad ≈ 4.03°.","Lumens are a property of the light source, independent of the engine f-number.","The projected pixel size is set by the DMD pitch alone."],"answer":0,"explanation":"級間角距 λ/p = 0.532/7.56 = 0.0704 rad ≈ 4.03°；入射 24° 時第 m 級方向 sinθ_m = m·0.0704 − 0.4067，m = 6 給 0.89°、m = 5 給 −3.1°，皆在 f/2.4 的 ±12° 錐內。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"The order spacing is λ/p = 0.532/7.56 = 0.0704 rad ≈ 4.03°; at 24° incidence the m-th order lies at sinθ_m = m·0.0704 − 0.4067, giving 0.89° for m = 6 and −3.1° for m = 5, both inside the ±12° cone of f/2.4. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a420-v12-07","title":"鏡陣繞射與光展量上限：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Array diffraction and the étendue ceiling: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「7.56 µm 鏡面格點的繞射級」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Diffraction orders of the 7.56 µm mirror lattice” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以 532 nm 雷射擴束照射全白圖樣，在 1 m 處的屏幕上量繞射亮點間距，應為 1 m × tan(4.03°) ≈ 70 mm；再把 LED 換成已知面積與角分佈的光源，量進入投影鏡頭的流明，與光展量比值預測的收集效率比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Illuminate an all-white pattern with an expanded 532 nm laser and measure the spacing of diffraction spots on a screen 1 m away, expected at 1 m × tan(4.03°) ≈ 70 mm; then swap in an LED of known area and angular distribution, measure the lumens entering the projection lens and compare with the collection efficiency predicted by the étendue ratio. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：選用 4×4 mm 的高功率 LED 想提高亮度，光展量 50 mm²·sr 是引擎的三倍，多出的三分之二光在積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡處被截掉並轉為熱，亮度未增反而把稜鏡膠合層烤裂。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Choosing a 4×4 mm high-power LED for brightness brings 50 mm²·sr of étendue, three times the engine's; two thirds of the light is clipped at the integrator rod and TIR prism and becomes heat, brightness does not rise and the prism cement cracks.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以 532 nm 雷射擴束照射全白圖樣，在 1 m 處的屏幕上量繞射亮點間距，應為 1 m × tan(4.03°) ≈ 70 mm；再把 LED 換成已知面積與角分佈的光源，量進入投影鏡頭的流明，與光展量比值預測的收集效率比較。","textEn":"Illuminate an all-white pattern with an expanded 532 nm laser and measure the spacing of diffraction spots on a screen 1 m away, expected at 1 m × tan(4.03°) ≈ 70 mm; then swap in an LED of known area and angular distribution, measure the lumens entering the projection lens and compare with the collection efficiency predicted by the étendue ratio.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「鏡陣繞射與光展量上限」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Array diffraction and the étendue ceiling\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以 532 nm 雷射擴束照射全白圖樣，在 1 m 處的屏幕上量繞射亮點間距，應為 1 m × tan(4.03°) ≈ 70 mm。","顯示用的均勻度規格對任何應用都足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Illuminate an all-white pattern with an expanded 532 nm laser and measure the spacing of diffraction spots on a screen 1 m away, expected at 1 m × tan(4.03°) ≈ 70 mm.","A display-grade uniformity specification is enough for any application."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以 532 nm 雷射擴束照射全白圖樣，在 1 m 處的屏幕上量繞射亮點間距，應為 1 m × tan(4.03°) ≈ 70 mm；再把 LED 換成已知面積與角分佈的光源，量進入投影鏡頭的流明，與光展量比值預測的收集效率比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Illuminate an all-white pattern with an expanded 532 nm laser and measure the spacing of diffraction spots on a screen 1 m away, expected at 1 m × tan(4.03°) ≈ 70 mm; then swap in an LED of known area and angular distribution, measure the lumens entering the projection lens and compare with the collection efficiency predicted by the étendue ratio. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a420-v12-08","title":"鏡陣繞射與光展量上限：失效診斷","titleEn":"Array diffraction and the étendue ceiling: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「7.56 µm 鏡面格點的繞射級」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Diffraction orders of the 7.56 µm mirror lattice” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"選用 4×4 mm 的高功率 LED 想提高亮度，光展量 50 mm²·sr 是引擎的三倍，多出的三分之二光在積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡處被截掉並轉為熱，亮度未增反而把稜鏡膠合層烤裂。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Choosing a 4×4 mm high-power LED for brightness brings 50 mm²·sr of étendue, three times the engine's; two thirds of the light is clipped at the integrator rod and TIR prism and becomes heat, brightness does not rise and the prism cement cracks. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：光展量 G = A·π·sin²θ 由鏡面面積與可接受的錐角決定，光源的光展量一旦超過它，多出的光無論如何都進不了引擎。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The étendue G = A·π·sin²θ is fixed by mirror area and acceptance cone, and any source étendue beyond it cannot enter the engine by any means.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「光源功率越大，投影亮度一定越高。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Higher source power always gives a brighter projection.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"選用 4×4 mm 的高功率 LED 想提高亮度，光展量 50 mm²·sr 是引擎的三倍，多出的三分之二光在積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡處被截掉並轉為熱，亮度未增反而把稜鏡膠合層烤裂。","textEn":"Choosing a 4×4 mm high-power LED for brightness brings 50 mm²·sr of étendue, three times the engine's; two thirds of the light is clipped at the integrator rod and TIR prism and becomes heat, brightness does not rise and the prism cement cracks.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「鏡陣繞射與光展量上限」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Array diffraction and the étendue ceiling\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","微鏡是類比連續偏轉的，可以停在任意角度。","選用 4×4 mm 的高功率 LED 想提高亮度，光展量 50 mm²·sr 是引擎的三倍，多出的三分之二光在積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡處被截掉並轉為熱，亮度未增反而把稜鏡膠合層烤裂。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","Micromirrors deflect continuously and can be held at any angle.","Choosing a 4×4 mm high-power LED for brightness brings 50 mm²·sr of étendue, three times the engine's."],"answer":2,"explanation":"選用 4×4 mm 的高功率 LED 想提高亮度，光展量 50 mm²·sr 是引擎的三倍，多出的三分之二光在積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡處被截掉並轉為熱，亮度未增反而把稜鏡膠合層烤裂。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Choosing a 4×4 mm high-power LED for brightness brings 50 mm²·sr of étendue, three times the engine's; two thirds of the light is clipped at the integrator rod and TIR prism and becomes heat, brightness does not rise and the prism cement cracks. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a420-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「DMD 元件結構與切換動力學」與「照明光路：積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"DMD device structure and switching dynamics\" and \"Illumination train: integrator rod and TIR prism\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a420-v12-09","title":"DMD 元件結構與切換動力學：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"DMD device structure and switching dynamics: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「鋁鏡面、扭轉鉸鏈與 CMOS SRAM 單元」如何決定數位微鏡光學引擎的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Aluminium mirror, torsion hinge and CMOS SRAM cell” determines the key performance of “Digital-micromirror optical engines”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"每個像素由鋁鏡面、下方的軛與扭轉鉸鏈、定址電極以及 CMOS 記憶單元組成：記憶單元先寫入下一個狀態，重置脈衝釋放鏡面後靜電力把它拉到對應的著陸點，鉸鏈的扭轉在數微秒內完成並在著陸點以機械止擋與彈簧尖端定住。鏡面之間留有次微米間隙與中央通孔，決定填充因子；密封窗口鍍增透膜並承受全部光功率。鉸鏈的疲勞壽命以兆次切換計，而鏡面黏附是主要的可靠度風險。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「鋁鏡面、扭轉鉸鏈與 CMOS SRAM 單元」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Each pixel consists of an aluminium mirror, a yoke and torsion hinge beneath it, address electrodes and a CMOS memory cell: the memory cell is written with the next state first, a reset pulse releases the mirror and electrostatic force pulls it to the matching landing point, where the hinge twist completes in a few microseconds and spring tips hold it against a mechanical stop. Sub-micrometre gaps between mirrors and the central via set the fill factor; a sealed window with antireflection coating carries the full optical power. Hinge fatigue life is counted in trillions of cycles, and mirror stiction is the main reliability risk. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Aluminium mirror, torsion hinge and CMOS SRAM cell”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：填充因子 ≈ ((p − g)/p)²：p = 7.56 µm、間隙 g = 0.3 µm 時 ≈ 92%。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Fill factor ≈ ((p − g)/p)²: with p = 7.56 µm and gap g = 0.3 µm it is about 92%.","failure":"常見誤解：「微鏡是類比連續偏轉的，可以停在任意角度。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Micromirrors deflect continuously and can be held at any angle.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「鋁鏡面、扭轉鉸鏈與 CMOS SRAM 單元」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Aluminium mirror, torsion hinge and CMOS SRAM cell”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-09-k1","title":"DMD 元件結構與切換動力學","titleEn":"DMD device structure and switching dynamics","text":"每個像素由鋁鏡面、下方的軛與扭轉鉸鏈、定址電極以及 CMOS 記憶單元組成：記憶單元先寫入下一個狀態，重置脈衝釋放鏡面後靜電力把它拉到對應的著陸點，鉸鏈的扭轉在數微秒內完成並在著陸點以機械止擋與彈簧尖端定住。鏡面之間留有次微米間隙與中央通孔，決定填充因子；密封窗口鍍增透膜並承受全部光功率。","textEn":"Each pixel consists of an aluminium mirror, a yoke and torsion hinge beneath it, address electrodes and a CMOS memory cell: the memory cell is written with the next state first, a reset pulse releases the mirror and electrostatic force pulls it to the matching landing point, where the hinge twist completes in a few microseconds and spring tips hold it against a mechanical stop. Sub-micrometre gaps between mirrors and the central via set the fill factor; a sealed window with antireflection coating carries the full optical power.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：微鏡是類比連續偏轉的，可以停在任意角度。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Micromirrors deflect continuously and can be held at any angle. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「DMD 元件結構與切換動力學」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"DMD device structure and switching dynamics\" is correct?","options":["每個像素由鋁鏡面、下方的軛與扭轉鉸鏈、定址電極以及 CMOS 記憶單元組成：記憶單元先寫入下一個狀態，重置脈衝釋放鏡面後靜電力把它拉到對應的著陸點，鉸鏈的扭轉在數微秒內完成並在著陸點以機械止擋與彈簧尖端定住。","微鏡是類比連續偏轉的，可以停在任意角度。","積分柱越長均勻度越好，所以長度沒有代價。"],"optionsEn":["Each pixel consists of an aluminium mirror, a yoke and torsion hinge beneath it, address electrodes and a CMOS memory cell: the memory cell is written with the next state first, a reset pulse releases the mirror and electrostatic force pulls it to the matching landing point, where the hinge twist completes in a few microseconds and spring tips hold it against a mechanical stop.","Micromirrors deflect continuously and can be held at any angle.","A longer integrator rod always improves uniformity, so length has no cost."],"answer":0,"explanation":"每個像素由鋁鏡面、下方的軛與扭轉鉸鏈、定址電極以及 CMOS 記憶單元組成：記憶單元先寫入下一個狀態，重置脈衝釋放鏡面後靜電力把它拉到對應的著陸點，鉸鏈的扭轉在數微秒內完成並在著陸點以機械止擋與彈簧尖端定住。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Each pixel consists of an aluminium mirror, a yoke and torsion hinge beneath it, address electrodes and a CMOS memory cell: the memory cell is written with the next state first, a reset pulse releases the mirror and electrostatic force pulls it to the matching landing point, where the hinge twist completes in a few microseconds and spring tips hold it against a mechanical stop. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a420-v12-10","title":"DMD 元件結構與切換動力學：定量估算","titleEn":"DMD device structure and switching dynamics: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「鋁鏡面、扭轉鉸鏈與 CMOS SRAM 單元」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Aluminium mirror, torsion hinge and CMOS SRAM cell” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：填充因子 ≈ ((p − g)/p)²：p = 7.56 µm、間隙 g = 0.3 µm 時 ≈ 92%。1920×1080 二元圖樣率 11,574 Hz 對應每圖樣 86.4 µs，資料率 2.07 Mbit × 11,574/s ≈ 24 Gbit/s；8 位元灰階 1,446 Hz 的每幀 691 µs，最低位元時槽 691/255 ≈ 2.7 µs，與鏡面穩定時間同量級。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Fill factor ≈ ((p − g)/p)²: with p = 7.56 µm and gap g = 0.3 µm it is about 92%. A 1920×1080 binary pattern rate of 11,574 Hz means 86.4 µs per pattern and a data rate of 2.07 Mbit × 11,574/s ≈ 24 Gbit/s; 8-bit grey at 1,446 Hz gives 691 µs per frame and a least-significant-bit slot of 691/255 ≈ 2.7 µs, the same order as mirror settling time. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以高速光電二極體對準單一鏡面或小區塊，示波器記錄切換後反射光的暫態與振鈴，量得穩定時間並與控制器的消隱時間比較；長期則以老化架連續切換並定期以顯微鏡與全白／全黑影像檢查黏附與損壞像素數。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Aim a fast photodiode at a single mirror or small block and record the reflected-light transient and ringing after a switch on an oscilloscope, comparing the settling time with the controller's blanking time; for lifetime, cycle devices continuously on a burn-in rack and periodically count stuck or damaged pixels with a microscope and all-white/all-black images.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"填充因子 ≈ ((p − g)/p)²：p = 7.56 µm、間隙 g = 0.3 µm 時 ≈ 92%。1920×1080 二元圖樣率 11,574 Hz 對應每圖樣 86.4 µs，資料率 2.07 Mbit × 11,574/s ≈ 24 Gbit/s；8 位元灰階 1,446 Hz 的每幀 691 µs，最低位元時槽 691/255 ≈ 2.7 µs，與鏡面穩定時間同量級。","textEn":"Fill factor ≈ ((p − g)/p)²: with p = 7.56 µm and gap g = 0.3 µm it is about 92%. A 1920×1080 binary pattern rate of 11,574 Hz means 86.4 µs per pattern and a data rate of 2.07 Mbit × 11,574/s ≈ 24 Gbit/s; 8-bit grey at 1,446 Hz gives 691 µs per frame and a least-significant-bit slot of 691/255 ≈ 2.7 µs, the same order as mirror settling time.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「DMD 元件結構與切換動力學」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"DMD device structure and switching dynamics\", which statement holds?","options":["鏡面是反射的，所以 DMD 不會吸收光功率、不需要散熱。","填充因子 ≈ ((p − g)/p)²：p = 7.56 µm、間隙 g = 0.3 µm 時 ≈ 92%。","顯示用的均勻度規格對任何應用都足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Mirrors reflect, so a DMD absorbs no optical power and needs no cooling.","Fill factor ≈ ((p − g)/p)²: with p = 7.56 µm and gap g = 0.3 µm it is about 92%.","A display-grade uniformity specification is enough for any application."],"answer":1,"explanation":"填充因子 ≈ ((p − g)/p)²：p = 7.56 µm、間隙 g = 0.3 µm 時 ≈ 92%。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Fill factor ≈ ((p − g)/p)²: with p = 7.56 µm and gap g = 0.3 µm it is about 92%. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a420-v12-11","title":"DMD 元件結構與切換動力學：量測與驗證","titleEn":"DMD device structure and switching dynamics: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「鋁鏡面、扭轉鉸鏈與 CMOS SRAM 單元」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Aluminium mirror, torsion hinge and CMOS SRAM cell” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以高速光電二極體對準單一鏡面或小區塊，示波器記錄切換後反射光的暫態與振鈴，量得穩定時間並與控制器的消隱時間比較；長期則以老化架連續切換並定期以顯微鏡與全白／全黑影像檢查黏附與損壞像素數。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Aim a fast photodiode at a single mirror or small block and record the reflected-light transient and ringing after a switch on an oscilloscope, comparing the settling time with the controller's blanking time; for lifetime, cycle devices continuously on a burn-in rack and periodically count stuck or damaged pixels with a microscope and all-white/all-black images. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：窗口內殘留水氣使鏡面在著陸點黏附，以全黑圖樣長時間停放後部分像素無法釋放，畫面出現固定亮點；重置脈衝加強也無法恢復，只能更換元件。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Residual moisture inside the window makes mirrors stick at the landing point; after a long hold on an all-black pattern some pixels fail to release and appear as fixed bright dots, stronger reset pulses do not recover them and the device must be replaced.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以高速光電二極體對準單一鏡面或小區塊，示波器記錄切換後反射光的暫態與振鈴，量得穩定時間並與控制器的消隱時間比較；長期則以老化架連續切換並定期以顯微鏡與全白／全黑影像檢查黏附與損壞像素數。","textEn":"Aim a fast photodiode at a single mirror or small block and record the reflected-light transient and ringing after a switch on an oscilloscope, comparing the settling time with the controller's blanking time; for lifetime, cycle devices continuously on a burn-in rack and periodically count stuck or damaged pixels with a microscope and all-white/all-black images.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「DMD 元件結構與切換動力學」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"DMD device structure and switching dynamics\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","微鏡只是一面小鏡子，照明角度可以任意選。","以高速光電二極體對準單一鏡面或小區塊，示波器記錄切換後反射光的暫態與振鈴，量得穩定時間並與控制器的消隱時間比較。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","A micromirror is just a tiny mirror, so the illumination angle can be anything.","Aim a fast photodiode at a single mirror or small block and record the reflected-light transient and ringing after a switch on an oscilloscope, comparing the settling time with the controller's blanking time."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以高速光電二極體對準單一鏡面或小區塊，示波器記錄切換後反射光的暫態與振鈴，量得穩定時間並與控制器的消隱時間比較；長期則以老化架連續切換並定期以顯微鏡與全白／全黑影像檢查黏附與損壞像素數。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Aim a fast photodiode at a single mirror or small block and record the reflected-light transient and ringing after a switch on an oscilloscope, comparing the settling time with the controller's blanking time; for lifetime, cycle devices continuously on a burn-in rack and periodically count stuck or damaged pixels with a microscope and all-white/all-black images. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a420-v12-12","title":"DMD 元件結構與切換動力學：失效診斷","titleEn":"DMD device structure and switching dynamics: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「鋁鏡面、扭轉鉸鏈與 CMOS SRAM 單元」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Aluminium mirror, torsion hinge and CMOS SRAM cell” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"窗口內殘留水氣使鏡面在著陸點黏附，以全黑圖樣長時間停放後部分像素無法釋放，畫面出現固定亮點；重置脈衝加強也無法恢復，只能更換元件。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Residual moisture inside the window makes mirrors stick at the landing point; after a long hold on an all-black pattern some pixels fail to release and appear as fixed bright dots, stronger reset pulses do not recover them and the device must be replaced. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：鉸鏈的疲勞壽命以兆次切換計，而鏡面黏附是主要的可靠度風險。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Hinge fatigue life is counted in trillions of cycles, and mirror stiction is the main reliability risk.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「微鏡是類比連續偏轉的，可以停在任意角度。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Micromirrors deflect continuously and can be held at any angle.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"窗口內殘留水氣使鏡面在著陸點黏附，以全黑圖樣長時間停放後部分像素無法釋放，畫面出現固定亮點；重置脈衝加強也無法恢復，只能更換元件。","textEn":"Residual moisture inside the window makes mirrors stick at the landing point; after a long hold on an all-black pattern some pixels fail to release and appear as fixed bright dots, stronger reset pulses do not recover them and the device must be replaced.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「DMD 元件結構與切換動力學」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"DMD device structure and switching dynamics\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["窗口內殘留水氣使鏡面在著陸點黏附，以全黑圖樣長時間停放後部分像素無法釋放，畫面出現固定亮點；重置脈衝加強也無法恢復，只能更換元件。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","積分柱越長均勻度越好，所以長度沒有代價。"],"optionsEn":["Residual moisture inside the window makes mirrors stick at the landing point.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A longer integrator rod always improves uniformity, so length has no cost."],"answer":0,"explanation":"窗口內殘留水氣使鏡面在著陸點黏附，以全黑圖樣長時間停放後部分像素無法釋放，畫面出現固定亮點；重置脈衝加強也無法恢復，只能更換元件。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Residual moisture inside the window makes mirrors stick at the landing point; after a long hold on an all-black pattern some pixels fail to release and appear as fixed bright dots, stronger reset pulses do not recover them and the device must be replaced. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a420-v12-13","title":"照明光路：積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Illumination train: integrator rod and TIR prism: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「積分柱、中繼鏡組與 TIR 稜鏡」如何決定數位微鏡光學引擎的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Integrator rod, relay optics and TIR prism” determines the key performance of “Digital-micromirror optical engines”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"照明光路要把光源的空間與角度分佈轉成在 DMD 上均勻、錐角剛好 f/2.4、長寬比 16:9 的照明。積分柱靠多次全反射把輸入端的不均勻打散，出口面以中繼鏡組放大成像到 DMD；光展量守恆使放大倍率同時縮小角度，所以柱內光錐遠比 DMD 上陡。TIR 稜鏡把 24° 入射的照明光以全反射折向 DMD，而法線方向的開態光穿過同一個空氣間隙進入投影鏡頭，讓照明與投影在極短的後焦距內共用空間。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「積分柱、中繼鏡組與 TIR 稜鏡」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The illumination train must turn the source's spatial and angular distribution into uniform illumination on the DMD with exactly an f/2.4 cone and a 16:9 shape. The integrator rod scrambles the input non-uniformity by multiple total internal reflections, and relay optics image its exit face onto the DMD with magnification; étendue conservation makes that magnification shrink the angles, so the cone inside the rod is far steeper than at the DMD. The TIR prism folds the 24° illumination onto the DMD by total internal reflection while the on-state light along the normal passes through the same air gap into the projection lens, letting illumination and projection share space within a very short back focal distance. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Integrator rod, relay optics and TIR prism”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：柱出口 3.6×2.0 mm 放大 M = 14.5/3.6 ≈ 4.0 倍到 DMD；光展量守恆 sinθ_rod = M·sinθ_DMD = 4×0.2079 = 0.83（空氣中 56°），玻璃內 sin = 0.83/1.5 = 0.554（33.7°，tan ≈ 0.667）；20 mm 長的柱每軸反射次數 ≈ 20×0.667/3.6 ≈ 3.7 次，達到 ≥3 次的均勻性經驗值。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: A rod exit of 3.6×2.0 mm is magnified M = 14.5/3.6 ≈ 4.0 onto the DMD; étendue conservation gives sinθ_rod = M·sinθ_DMD = 4×0.2079 = 0.83 (56° in air), inside the glass sin = 0.83/1.5 = 0.554 (33.7°, tan ≈ 0.667); a 20 mm rod then makes ≈ 20×0.667/3.6 ≈ 3.7 reflections per axis, meeting the rule of thumb of at least 3.","failure":"常見誤解：「積分柱越長均勻度越好，所以長度沒有代價。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A longer integrator rod always improves uniformity, so length has no cost.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「積分柱、中繼鏡組與 TIR 稜鏡」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Integrator rod, relay optics and TIR prism”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-13-k1","title":"照明光路：積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡","titleEn":"Illumination train: integrator rod and TIR prism","text":"照明光路要把光源的空間與角度分佈轉成在 DMD 上均勻、錐角剛好 f/2.4、長寬比 16:9 的照明。積分柱靠多次全反射把輸入端的不均勻打散，出口面以中繼鏡組放大成像到 DMD；光展量守恆使放大倍率同時縮小角度，所以柱內光錐遠比 DMD 上陡。","textEn":"The illumination train must turn the source's spatial and angular distribution into uniform illumination on the DMD with exactly an f/2.4 cone and a 16:9 shape. The integrator rod scrambles the input non-uniformity by multiple total internal reflections, and relay optics image its exit face onto the DMD with magnification; étendue conservation makes that magnification shrink the angles, so the cone inside the rod is far steeper than at the DMD.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：積分柱越長均勻度越好，所以長度沒有代價。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A longer integrator rod always improves uniformity, so length has no cost. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「照明光路：積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Illumination train: integrator rod and TIR prism\" is correct?","options":["積分柱越長均勻度越好，所以長度沒有代價。","照明光路要把光源的空間與角度分佈轉成在 DMD 上均勻、錐角剛好 f/2.4、長寬比 16:9 的照明。","流明是光源的屬性，與引擎的 f 數無關。"],"optionsEn":["A longer integrator rod always improves uniformity, so length has no cost.","The illumination train must turn the source's spatial and angular distribution into uniform illumination on the DMD with exactly an f/2.4 cone and a 16:9 shape.","Lumens are a property of the light source, independent of the engine f-number."],"answer":1,"explanation":"照明光路要把光源的空間與角度分佈轉成在 DMD 上均勻、錐角剛好 f/2.4、長寬比 16:9 的照明。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The illumination train must turn the source's spatial and angular distribution into uniform illumination on the DMD with exactly an f/2.4 cone and a 16:9 shape. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a420-v12-14","title":"照明光路：積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡：定量估算","titleEn":"Illumination train: integrator rod and TIR prism: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「積分柱、中繼鏡組與 TIR 稜鏡」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Integrator rod, relay optics and TIR prism” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：柱出口 3.6×2.0 mm 放大 M = 14.5/3.6 ≈ 4.0 倍到 DMD；光展量守恆 sinθ_rod = M·sinθ_DMD = 4×0.2079 = 0.83（空氣中 56°），玻璃內 sin = 0.83/1.5 = 0.554（33.7°，tan ≈ 0.667）；20 mm 長的柱每軸反射次數 ≈ 20×0.667/3.6 ≈ 3.7 次，達到 ≥3 次的均勻性經驗值。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: A rod exit of 3.6×2.0 mm is magnified M = 14.5/3.6 ≈ 4.0 onto the DMD; étendue conservation gives sinθ_rod = M·sinθ_DMD = 4×0.2079 = 0.83 (56° in air), inside the glass sin = 0.83/1.5 = 0.554 (33.7°, tan ≈ 0.667); a 20 mm rod then makes ≈ 20×0.667/3.6 ≈ 3.7 reflections per axis, meeting the rule of thumb of at least 3. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在 DMD 位置放一片漫射屏，用相機從投影側量照度分佈，計算 9 點均勻度與邊緣衰減；再用光束分析儀在 DMD 面量角分佈，確認錐半角 12° 且中心指向 24°；若均勻度不足，延長積分柱或增加反射次數後重量。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Put a diffuser at the DMD position and image the illuminance distribution from the projection side with a camera to compute 9-point uniformity and edge roll-off; then measure the angular distribution at the DMD plane with a beam profiler to confirm a 12° half-angle centred on 24°; if uniformity is short, lengthen the rod or raise the number of reflections and re-measure.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"柱出口 3.6×2.0 mm 放大 M = 14.5/3.6 ≈ 4.0 倍到 DMD；光展量守恆 sinθ_rod = M·sinθ_DMD = 4×0.2079 = 0.83（空氣中 56°），玻璃內 sin = 0.83/1.5 = 0.554（33.7°，tan ≈ 0.667）；20 mm 長的柱每軸反射次數 ≈ 20×0.667/3.6 ≈ 3.7 次，達到 ≥3 次的均勻性經驗值。","textEn":"A rod exit of 3.6×2.0 mm is magnified M = 14.5/3.6 ≈ 4.0 onto the DMD; étendue conservation gives sinθ_rod = M·sinθ_DMD = 4×0.2079 = 0.83 (56° in air), inside the glass sin = 0.83/1.5 = 0.554 (33.7°, tan ≈ 0.667); a 20 mm rod then makes ≈ 20×0.667/3.6 ≈ 3.7 reflections per axis, meeting the rule of thumb of at least 3.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「照明光路：積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Illumination train: integrator rod and TIR prism\", which statement holds?","options":["投影像素尺寸只由 DMD 像素間距決定。","微鏡只是一面小鏡子，照明角度可以任意選。","柱出口 3.6×2.0 mm 放大 M = 14.5/3.6 ≈ 4.0 倍到 DMD。"],"optionsEn":["The projected pixel size is set by the DMD pitch alone.","A micromirror is just a tiny mirror, so the illumination angle can be anything.","A rod exit of 3.6×2.0 mm is magnified M = 14.5/3.6 ≈ 4.0 onto the DMD."],"answer":2,"explanation":"柱出口 3.6×2.0 mm 放大 M = 14.5/3.6 ≈ 4.0 倍到 DMD；光展量守恆 sinθ_rod = M·sinθ_DMD = 4×0.2079 = 0.83（空氣中 56°），玻璃內 sin = 0.83/1.5 = 0.554（33.7°，tan ≈ 0.667）；20 mm 長的柱每軸反射次數 ≈ 20×0.667/3.6 ≈ 3.7 次，達到 ≥3 次的均勻性經驗值。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"A rod exit of 3.6×2.0 mm is magnified M = 14.5/3.6 ≈ 4.0 onto the DMD; étendue conservation gives sinθ_rod = M·sinθ_DMD = 4×0.2079 = 0.83 (56° in air), inside the glass sin = 0.83/1.5 = 0.554 (33.7°, tan ≈ 0.667); a 20 mm rod then makes ≈ 20×0.667/3.6 ≈ 3.7 reflections per axis, meeting the rule of thumb of at least 3. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a420-v12-15","title":"照明光路：積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Illumination train: integrator rod and TIR prism: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「積分柱、中繼鏡組與 TIR 稜鏡」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Integrator rod, relay optics and TIR prism” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在 DMD 位置放一片漫射屏，用相機從投影側量照度分佈，計算 9 點均勻度與邊緣衰減；再用光束分析儀在 DMD 面量角分佈，確認錐半角 12° 且中心指向 24°；若均勻度不足，延長積分柱或增加反射次數後重量。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Put a diffuser at the DMD position and image the illuminance distribution from the projection side with a camera to compute 9-point uniformity and edge roll-off; then measure the angular distribution at the DMD plane with a beam profiler to confirm a 12° half-angle centred on 24°; if uniformity is short, lengthen the rod or raise the number of reflections and re-measure. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：TIR 稜鏡的空氣間隙被膠或灰塵部分填滿，局部不再滿足全反射，照明在 DMD 上出現暗帶，而且部分照明光直接穿入投影鏡頭形成亮霧，對比與均勻度同時劣化。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the TIR prism's air gap is partly filled by cement or dust, total internal reflection fails locally, a dark band appears on the DMD and some illumination passes straight into the projection lens as haze, degrading contrast and uniformity together.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在 DMD 位置放一片漫射屏，用相機從投影側量照度分佈，計算 9 點均勻度與邊緣衰減；再用光束分析儀在 DMD 面量角分佈，確認錐半角 12° 且中心指向 24°；若均勻度不足，延長積分柱或增加反射次數後重量。","textEn":"Put a diffuser at the DMD position and image the illuminance distribution from the projection side with a camera to compute 9-point uniformity and edge roll-off; then measure the angular distribution at the DMD plane with a beam profiler to confirm a 12° half-angle centred on 24°; if uniformity is short, lengthen the rod or raise the number of reflections and re-measure.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「照明光路：積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Illumination train: integrator rod and TIR prism\"?","options":["在 DMD 位置放一片漫射屏，用相機從投影側量照度分佈，計算 9 點均勻度與邊緣衰減。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","光源功率越大，投影亮度一定越高。"],"optionsEn":["Put a diffuser at the DMD position and image the illuminance distribution from the projection side with a camera to compute 9-point uniformity and edge roll-off.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Higher source power always gives a brighter projection."],"answer":0,"explanation":"在 DMD 位置放一片漫射屏，用相機從投影側量照度分佈，計算 9 點均勻度與邊緣衰減；再用光束分析儀在 DMD 面量角分佈，確認錐半角 12° 且中心指向 24°；若均勻度不足，延長積分柱或增加反射次數後重量。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Put a diffuser at the DMD position and image the illuminance distribution from the projection side with a camera to compute 9-point uniformity and edge roll-off; then measure the angular distribution at the DMD plane with a beam profiler to confirm a 12° half-angle centred on 24°; if uniformity is short, lengthen the rod or raise the number of reflections and re-measure. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a420-v12-16","title":"照明光路：積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡：失效診斷","titleEn":"Illumination train: integrator rod and TIR prism: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「積分柱、中繼鏡組與 TIR 稜鏡」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Integrator rod, relay optics and TIR prism” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"TIR 稜鏡的空氣間隙被膠或灰塵部分填滿，局部不再滿足全反射，照明在 DMD 上出現暗帶，而且部分照明光直接穿入投影鏡頭形成亮霧，對比與均勻度同時劣化。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the TIR prism's air gap is partly filled by cement or dust, total internal reflection fails locally, a dark band appears on the DMD and some illumination passes straight into the projection lens as haze, degrading contrast and uniformity together. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：TIR 稜鏡把 24° 入射的照明光以全反射折向 DMD，而法線方向的開態光穿過同一個空氣間隙進入投影鏡頭，讓照明與投影在極短的後焦距內共用空間。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The TIR prism folds the 24° illumination onto the DMD by total internal reflection while the on-state light along the normal passes through the same air gap into the projection lens, letting illumination and projection share space within a very short back focal distance.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「積分柱越長均勻度越好，所以長度沒有代價。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A longer integrator rod always improves uniformity, so length has no cost.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"TIR 稜鏡的空氣間隙被膠或灰塵部分填滿，局部不再滿足全反射，照明在 DMD 上出現暗帶，而且部分照明光直接穿入投影鏡頭形成亮霧，對比與均勻度同時劣化。","textEn":"If the TIR prism's air gap is partly filled by cement or dust, total internal reflection fails locally, a dark band appears on the DMD and some illumination passes straight into the projection lens as haze, degrading contrast and uniformity together.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「照明光路：積分柱與 TIR 稜鏡」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Illumination train: integrator rod and TIR prism\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","TIR 稜鏡的空氣間隙被膠或灰塵部分填滿，局部不再滿足全反射，照明在 DMD 上出現暗帶，而且部分照明光直接穿入投影鏡頭形成亮霧，對比與均勻度同時劣化。","流明是光源的屬性，與引擎的 f 數無關。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","If the TIR prism's air gap is partly filled by cement or dust, total internal reflection fails locally, a dark band appears on the DMD and some illumination passes straight into the projection lens as haze, degrading contrast and uniformity together.","Lumens are a property of the light source, independent of the engine f-number."],"answer":1,"explanation":"TIR 稜鏡的空氣間隙被膠或灰塵部分填滿，局部不再滿足全反射，照明在 DMD 上出現暗帶，而且部分照明光直接穿入投影鏡頭形成亮霧，對比與均勻度同時劣化。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the TIR prism's air gap is partly filled by cement or dust, total internal reflection fails locally, a dark band appears on the DMD and some illumination passes straight into the projection lens as haze, degrading contrast and uniformity together. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a420-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「亮度鏈、對比與時序量測」與「熱負載、灰階時序與誤差預算」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Flux chain, contrast and timing measurement\" and \"Thermal load, grey-scale timing and error budget\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a420-v12-17","title":"亮度鏈、對比與時序量測：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Flux chain, contrast and timing measurement: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「積分球、9 點照度計與高速光電二極體」如何決定數位微鏡光學引擎的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Integrating sphere, 9-point lux meter and fast photodiode” determines the key performance of “Digital-micromirror optical engines”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"引擎驗收以三組量測為主：以 9 點照度乘以投影面積得到流明並與光源流明乘上各級效率的亮度鏈比較；以全白／全黑影像量順序對比、以 4×4 棋盤量 ANSI 對比，後者更能反映鏡頭的眩光；以高速光電二極體記錄單一像素在二元與灰階圖樣下的時間波形，檢查圖樣率、位元時槽與消隱。亮度鏈的每一項都要獨立量過，才能知道損失集中在哪一級。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「積分球、9 點照度計與高速光電二極體」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Engine acceptance rests on three measurement groups: luminous flux from 9-point illuminance times projected area, compared with the flux chain of source lumens multiplied by each stage efficiency; sequential contrast from all-white/all-black images and ANSI contrast from a 4×4 checkerboard, the latter exposing lens veiling glare; and the time waveform of a single pixel under binary and grey-scale patterns recorded with a fast photodiode to check pattern rate, bit slots and blanking. Every stage of the flux chain must be measured on its own to locate where the loss concentrates. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Integrating sphere, 9-point lux meter and fast photodiode”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：亮度鏈：LED 1500 lm × 收集 0.70 × 積分柱 0.90 × 中繼 0.90 × TIR 稜鏡 0.95 × DMD（填充 0.92 × 反射 0.88 × 繞射 0.86）× 投影鏡頭 0.90 ≈ 506 lm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Flux chain: LED 1500 lm × collection 0.70 × rod 0.90 × relay 0.90 × TIR prism 0.95 × DMD (fill 0.92 × reflectance 0.88 × diffraction 0.86) × projection lens 0.90 ≈ 506 lm.","failure":"常見誤解：「流明是光源的屬性，與引擎的 f 數無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Lumens are a property of the light source, independent of the engine f-number.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「積分球、9 點照度計與高速光電二極體」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Integrating sphere, 9-point lux meter and fast photodiode”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-17-k1","title":"亮度鏈、對比與時序量測","titleEn":"Flux chain, contrast and timing measurement","text":"引擎驗收以三組量測為主：以 9 點照度乘以投影面積得到流明並與光源流明乘上各級效率的亮度鏈比較；以全白／全黑影像量順序對比、以 4×4 棋盤量 ANSI 對比，後者更能反映鏡頭的眩光；以高速光電二極體記錄單一像素在二元與灰階圖樣下的時間波形，檢查圖樣率、位元時槽與消隱。亮度鏈的每一項都要獨立量過，才能知道損失集中在哪一級。","textEn":"Engine acceptance rests on three measurement groups: luminous flux from 9-point illuminance times projected area, compared with the flux chain of source lumens multiplied by each stage efficiency; sequential contrast from all-white/all-black images and ANSI contrast from a 4×4 checkerboard, the latter exposing lens veiling glare; and the time waveform of a single pixel under binary and grey-scale patterns recorded with a fast photodiode to check pattern rate, bit slots and blanking. Every stage of the flux chain must be measured on its own to locate where the loss concentrates.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：流明是光源的屬性，與引擎的 f 數無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Lumens are a property of the light source, independent of the engine f-number. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「亮度鏈、對比與時序量測」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Flux chain, contrast and timing measurement\" is correct?","options":["流明是光源的屬性，與引擎的 f 數無關。","鏡面是反射的，所以 DMD 不會吸收光功率、不需要散熱。","引擎驗收以三組量測為主：以 9 點照度乘以投影面積得到流明並與光源流明乘上各級效率的亮度鏈比較。"],"optionsEn":["Lumens are a property of the light source, independent of the engine f-number.","Mirrors reflect, so a DMD absorbs no optical power and needs no cooling.","Engine acceptance rests on three measurement groups: luminous flux from 9-point illuminance times projected area, compared with the flux chain of source lumens multiplied by each stage efficiency."],"answer":2,"explanation":"引擎驗收以三組量測為主：以 9 點照度乘以投影面積得到流明並與光源流明乘上各級效率的亮度鏈比較；以全白／全黑影像量順序對比、以 4×4 棋盤量 ANSI 對比，後者更能反映鏡頭的眩光；以高速光電二極體記錄單一像素在二元與灰階圖樣下的時間波形，檢查圖樣率、位元時槽與消隱。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Engine acceptance rests on three measurement groups: luminous flux from 9-point illuminance times projected area, compared with the flux chain of source lumens multiplied by each stage efficiency; sequential contrast from all-white/all-black images and ANSI contrast from a 4×4 checkerboard, the latter exposing lens veiling glare; and the time waveform of a single pixel under binary and grey-scale patterns recorded with a fast photodiode to check pattern rate, bit slots and blanking. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a420-v12-18","title":"亮度鏈、對比與時序量測：定量估算","titleEn":"Flux chain, contrast and timing measurement: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「積分球、9 點照度計與高速光電二極體」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Integrating sphere, 9-point lux meter and fast photodiode” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：亮度鏈：LED 1500 lm × 收集 0.70 × 積分柱 0.90 × 中繼 0.90 × TIR 稜鏡 0.95 × DMD（填充 0.92 × 反射 0.88 × 繞射 0.86）× 投影鏡頭 0.90 ≈ 506 lm。對比：關態與鏡面間隙散射 0.03% 加鏡頭眩光 0.02%，順序對比 ≈ 1/(0.0003 + 0.0002) = 2000:1。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Flux chain: LED 1500 lm × collection 0.70 × rod 0.90 × relay 0.90 × TIR prism 0.95 × DMD (fill 0.92 × reflectance 0.88 × diffraction 0.86) × projection lens 0.90 ≈ 506 lm. Contrast: 0.03% scatter from off-state mirrors and gaps plus 0.02% lens veiling glare gives a sequential contrast ≈ 1/(0.0003 + 0.0002) = 2000:1. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用積分球量 LED 裸光通量，再依序在積分柱出口、DMD 前、投影鏡頭後以同一照度計量流明，逐級填入亮度鏈表；對比用遮光暗室中校正過的照度計量全黑畫面，確保暗讀值高於儀器底噪 10 倍以上。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure the bare LED flux in an integrating sphere, then with the same lux meter measure lumens at the rod exit, before the DMD and after the projection lens, filling each stage of the flux-chain table; for contrast, measure the all-black frame in a darkened room with a calibrated meter and keep the dark reading at least 10 times above the instrument noise floor.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"亮度鏈：LED 1500 lm × 收集 0.70 × 積分柱 0.90 × 中繼 0.90 × TIR 稜鏡 0.95 × DMD（填充 0.92 × 反射 0.88 × 繞射 0.86）× 投影鏡頭 0.90 ≈ 506 lm。對比：關態與鏡面間隙散射 0.03% 加鏡頭眩光 0.02%，順序對比 ≈ 1/(0.0003 + 0.0002) = 2000:1。","textEn":"Flux chain: LED 1500 lm × collection 0.70 × rod 0.90 × relay 0.90 × TIR prism 0.95 × DMD (fill 0.92 × reflectance 0.88 × diffraction 0.86) × projection lens 0.90 ≈ 506 lm. Contrast: 0.03% scatter from off-state mirrors and gaps plus 0.02% lens veiling glare gives a sequential contrast ≈ 1/(0.0003 + 0.0002) = 2000:1.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「亮度鏈、對比與時序量測」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Flux chain, contrast and timing measurement\", which statement holds?","options":["亮度鏈：LED 1500 lm × 收集 0.70 × 積分柱 0.90 × 中繼 0.90 × TIR 稜鏡 0.95 × DMD（填充 0.92 × 反射 0.88 × 繞射 0.86）× 投影鏡頭 0.90 ≈ 506 lm。","顯示用的均勻度規格對任何應用都足夠。","光源功率越大，投影亮度一定越高。"],"optionsEn":["Flux chain: LED 1500 lm × collection 0.70 × rod 0.90 × relay 0.90 × TIR prism 0.95 × DMD (fill 0.92 × reflectance 0.88 × diffraction 0.86) × projection lens 0.90 ≈ 506 lm.","A display-grade uniformity specification is enough for any application.","Higher source power always gives a brighter projection."],"answer":0,"explanation":"亮度鏈：LED 1500 lm × 收集 0.70 × 積分柱 0.90 × 中繼 0.90 × TIR 稜鏡 0.95 × DMD（填充 0.92 × 反射 0.88 × 繞射 0.86）× 投影鏡頭 0.90 ≈ 506 lm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Flux chain: LED 1500 lm × collection 0.70 × rod 0.90 × relay 0.90 × TIR prism 0.95 × DMD (fill 0.92 × reflectance 0.88 × diffraction 0.86) × projection lens 0.90 ≈ 506 lm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a420-v12-19","title":"亮度鏈、對比與時序量測：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Flux chain, contrast and timing measurement: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「積分球、9 點照度計與高速光電二極體」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Integrating sphere, 9-point lux meter and fast photodiode” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用積分球量 LED 裸光通量，再依序在積分柱出口、DMD 前、投影鏡頭後以同一照度計量流明，逐級填入亮度鏈表；對比用遮光暗室中校正過的照度計量全黑畫面，確保暗讀值高於儀器底噪 10 倍以上。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure the bare LED flux in an integrating sphere, then with the same lux meter measure lumens at the rod exit, before the DMD and after the projection lens, filling each stage of the flux-chain table; for contrast, measure the all-black frame in a darkened room with a calibrated meter and keep the dark reading at least 10 times above the instrument noise floor. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：量亮度時把投影鏡頭光圈開到 f/2.0 以求高讀值，平態與關態漏光一併進入，流明虛高 15% 而對比腰斬，驗收數據互相矛盾。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Opening the projection lens to f/2.0 for a higher flux reading admits flat- and off-state leakage; lumens read 15% high while contrast halves, and the acceptance data contradict each other.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用積分球量 LED 裸光通量，再依序在積分柱出口、DMD 前、投影鏡頭後以同一照度計量流明，逐級填入亮度鏈表；對比用遮光暗室中校正過的照度計量全黑畫面，確保暗讀值高於儀器底噪 10 倍以上。","textEn":"Measure the bare LED flux in an integrating sphere, then with the same lux meter measure lumens at the rod exit, before the DMD and after the projection lens, filling each stage of the flux-chain table; for contrast, measure the all-black frame in a darkened room with a calibrated meter and keep the dark reading at least 10 times above the instrument noise floor.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「亮度鏈、對比與時序量測」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Flux chain, contrast and timing measurement\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","用積分球量 LED 裸光通量，再依序在積分柱出口、DMD 前、投影鏡頭後以同一照度計量流明，逐級填入亮度鏈表。","微鏡是類比連續偏轉的，可以停在任意角度。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Measure the bare LED flux in an integrating sphere, then with the same lux meter measure lumens at the rod exit, before the DMD and after the projection lens, filling each stage of the flux-chain table.","Micromirrors deflect continuously and can be held at any angle."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用積分球量 LED 裸光通量，再依序在積分柱出口、DMD 前、投影鏡頭後以同一照度計量流明，逐級填入亮度鏈表；對比用遮光暗室中校正過的照度計量全黑畫面，確保暗讀值高於儀器底噪 10 倍以上。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure the bare LED flux in an integrating sphere, then with the same lux meter measure lumens at the rod exit, before the DMD and after the projection lens, filling each stage of the flux-chain table; for contrast, measure the all-black frame in a darkened room with a calibrated meter and keep the dark reading at least 10 times above the instrument noise floor. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a420-v12-20","title":"亮度鏈、對比與時序量測：失效診斷","titleEn":"Flux chain, contrast and timing measurement: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「積分球、9 點照度計與高速光電二極體」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Integrating sphere, 9-point lux meter and fast photodiode” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"量亮度時把投影鏡頭光圈開到 f/2.0 以求高讀值，平態與關態漏光一併進入，流明虛高 15% 而對比腰斬，驗收數據互相矛盾。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Opening the projection lens to f/2.0 for a higher flux reading admits flat- and off-state leakage; lumens read 15% high while contrast halves, and the acceptance data contradict each other. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：亮度鏈的每一項都要獨立量過，才能知道損失集中在哪一級。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Every stage of the flux chain must be measured on its own to locate where the loss concentrates.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「流明是光源的屬性，與引擎的 f 數無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Lumens are a property of the light source, independent of the engine f-number.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"量亮度時把投影鏡頭光圈開到 f/2.0 以求高讀值，平態與關態漏光一併進入，流明虛高 15% 而對比腰斬，驗收數據互相矛盾。","textEn":"Opening the projection lens to f/2.0 for a higher flux reading admits flat- and off-state leakage; lumens read 15% high while contrast halves, and the acceptance data contradict each other.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「亮度鏈、對比與時序量測」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Flux chain, contrast and timing measurement\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","鏡面是反射的，所以 DMD 不會吸收光功率、不需要散熱。","量亮度時把投影鏡頭光圈開到 f/2.0 以求高讀值，平態與關態漏光一併進入，流明虛高 15% 而對比腰斬，驗收數據互相矛盾。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","Mirrors reflect, so a DMD absorbs no optical power and needs no cooling.","Opening the projection lens to f/2.0 for a higher flux reading admits flat- and off-state leakage."],"answer":2,"explanation":"量亮度時把投影鏡頭光圈開到 f/2.0 以求高讀值，平態與關態漏光一併進入，流明虛高 15% 而對比腰斬，驗收數據互相矛盾。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Opening the projection lens to f/2.0 for a higher flux reading admits flat- and off-state leakage; lumens read 15% high while contrast halves, and the acceptance data contradict each other. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a420-v12-21","title":"熱負載、灰階時序與誤差預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Thermal load, grey-scale timing and error budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「DMD 陣列溫度與熱阻模型」如何決定數位微鏡光學引擎的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “DMD array temperature and thermal-resistance model” determines the key performance of “Digital-micromirror optical engines”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"引擎的誤差預算把亮度、對比、均勻度與灰階準確度的損失各自歸到可量化的來源：DMD 吸收的光功率與驅動電功率決定陣列溫度，溫度過高會縮短鉸鏈壽命並改變切換時間；灰階由二進位時槽疊加而成，鏡面穩定時間與最低位元時槽同量級時，低灰階會非線性並出現輪廓；雷射照明的離散繞射級與相干散斑則讓均勻度隨波長與角度起伏。各項以均方根合成，再決定是否加散熱、降圖樣率或改用寬頻光源。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「DMD 陣列溫度與熱阻模型」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The engine error budget assigns losses in brightness, contrast, uniformity and grey-scale accuracy to quantifiable sources: optical power absorbed by the DMD plus drive electrical power sets the array temperature, and excess temperature shortens hinge life and alters switching time; grey levels are built from binary time slots, so when mirror settling is comparable to the least-significant-bit slot the low greys turn nonlinear and show contouring; under laser illumination the discrete diffraction orders and coherent speckle make uniformity vary with wavelength and angle. The items are root-sum-squared before deciding on more cooling, a lower pattern rate or a broadband source. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “DMD array temperature and thermal-resistance model”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：入射光 10 W、吸收 8% 得 0.8 W，加驅動電功率 1.5 W 共 2.3 W；晶片到底座熱阻 1.2 K/W、底座到環境 8 K/W（風冷）時陣列溫升 ≈ 2.3×9.2 ≈ 21 K，環境 35 °C 下陣列 56 °C，低於 70 °C 的典型上限。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Incident 10 W with 8% absorption gives 0.8 W, plus 1.5 W drive power, 2.3 W in total; with 1.2 K/W die-to-base and 8 K/W base-to-ambient (forced air) the array rises ≈ 2.3×9.2 ≈ 21 K, reaching 56 °C at 35 °C ambient, below the typical 70 °C limit.","failure":"常見誤解：「鏡面是反射的，所以 DMD 不會吸收光功率、不需要散熱。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Mirrors reflect, so a DMD absorbs no optical power and needs no cooling.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「DMD 陣列溫度與熱阻模型」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “DMD array temperature and thermal-resistance model”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-21-k1","title":"熱負載、灰階時序與誤差預算","titleEn":"Thermal load, grey-scale timing and error budget","text":"引擎的誤差預算把亮度、對比、均勻度與灰階準確度的損失各自歸到可量化的來源：DMD 吸收的光功率與驅動電功率決定陣列溫度，溫度過高會縮短鉸鏈壽命並改變切換時間；灰階由二進位時槽疊加而成，鏡面穩定時間與最低位元時槽同量級時，低灰階會非線性並出現輪廓；雷射照明的離散繞射級與相干散斑則讓均勻度隨波長與角度起伏。各項以均方根合成，再決定是否加散熱、降圖樣率或改用寬頻光源。","textEn":"The engine error budget assigns losses in brightness, contrast, uniformity and grey-scale accuracy to quantifiable sources: optical power absorbed by the DMD plus drive electrical power sets the array temperature, and excess temperature shortens hinge life and alters switching time; grey levels are built from binary time slots, so when mirror settling is comparable to the least-significant-bit slot the low greys turn nonlinear and show contouring; under laser illumination the discrete diffraction orders and coherent speckle make uniformity vary with wavelength and angle. The items are root-sum-squared before deciding on more cooling, a lower pattern rate or a broadband source.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：鏡面是反射的，所以 DMD 不會吸收光功率、不需要散熱。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Mirrors reflect, so a DMD absorbs no optical power and needs no cooling. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「熱負載、灰階時序與誤差預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Thermal load, grey-scale timing and error budget\" is correct?","options":["引擎的誤差預算把亮度、對比、均勻度與灰階準確度的損失各自歸到可量化的來源：DMD 吸收的光功率與驅動電功率決定陣列溫度，溫度過高會縮短鉸鏈壽命並改變切換時間。","鏡面是反射的，所以 DMD 不會吸收光功率、不需要散熱。","投影像素尺寸只由 DMD 像素間距決定。"],"optionsEn":["The engine error budget assigns losses in brightness, contrast, uniformity and grey-scale accuracy to quantifiable sources: optical power absorbed by the DMD plus drive electrical power sets the array temperature, and excess temperature shortens hinge life and alters switching time.","Mirrors reflect, so a DMD absorbs no optical power and needs no cooling.","The projected pixel size is set by the DMD pitch alone."],"answer":0,"explanation":"引擎的誤差預算把亮度、對比、均勻度與灰階準確度的損失各自歸到可量化的來源：DMD 吸收的光功率與驅動電功率決定陣列溫度，溫度過高會縮短鉸鏈壽命並改變切換時間；灰階由二進位時槽疊加而成，鏡面穩定時間與最低位元時槽同量級時，低灰階會非線性並出現輪廓；雷射照明的離散繞射級與相干散斑則讓均勻度隨波長與角度起伏。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The engine error budget assigns losses in brightness, contrast, uniformity and grey-scale accuracy to quantifiable sources: optical power absorbed by the DMD plus drive electrical power sets the array temperature, and excess temperature shortens hinge life and alters switching time; grey levels are built from binary time slots, so when mirror settling is comparable to the least-significant-bit slot the low greys turn nonlinear and show contouring; under laser illumination the discrete diffraction orders and coherent speckle make uniformity vary with wavelength and angle. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a420-v12-22","title":"熱負載、灰階時序與誤差預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Thermal load, grey-scale timing and error budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「DMD 陣列溫度與熱阻模型」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “DMD array temperature and thermal-resistance model” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：入射光 10 W、吸收 8% 得 0.8 W，加驅動電功率 1.5 W 共 2.3 W；晶片到底座熱阻 1.2 K/W、底座到環境 8 K/W（風冷）時陣列溫升 ≈ 2.3×9.2 ≈ 21 K，環境 35 °C 下陣列 56 °C，低於 70 °C 的典型上限。灰階：8 位元最低時槽 2.7 µs，鏡面穩定 5 µs，必須由控制器補償。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Incident 10 W with 8% absorption gives 0.8 W, plus 1.5 W drive power, 2.3 W in total; with 1.2 K/W die-to-base and 8 K/W base-to-ambient (forced air) the array rises ≈ 2.3×9.2 ≈ 21 K, reaching 56 °C at 35 °C ambient, below the typical 70 °C limit. Grey scale: the 8-bit least-significant slot of 2.7 µs against 5 µs mirror settling must be compensated by the controller. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以元件內建溫度感測或貼附熱電偶記錄陣列溫度對入射功率的斜率，與熱阻模型比較；用光電二極體量 0 到 255 灰階的時間平均光強，畫出電光轉換曲線並以最小平方擬合伽瑪，殘差超過 1 個灰階即需調整時槽補償表。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Log array temperature against incident power with the device's temperature sensor or an attached thermocouple and compare the slope with the thermal-resistance model; measure the time-averaged intensity for grey levels 0 to 255 with a photodiode, fit the electro-optical curve to a gamma by least squares, and adjust the slot-compensation table if residuals exceed one grey level.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"入射光 10 W、吸收 8% 得 0.8 W，加驅動電功率 1.5 W 共 2.3 W；晶片到底座熱阻 1.2 K/W、底座到環境 8 K/W（風冷）時陣列溫升 ≈ 2.3×9.2 ≈ 21 K，環境 35 °C 下陣列 56 °C，低於 70 °C 的典型上限。灰階：8 位元最低時槽 2.7 µs，鏡面穩定 5 µs，必須由控制器補償。","textEn":"Incident 10 W with 8% absorption gives 0.8 W, plus 1.5 W drive power, 2.3 W in total; with 1.2 K/W die-to-base and 8 K/W base-to-ambient (forced air) the array rises ≈ 2.3×9.2 ≈ 21 K, reaching 56 °C at 35 °C ambient, below the typical 70 °C limit. Grey scale: the 8-bit least-significant slot of 2.7 µs against 5 µs mirror settling must be compensated by the controller.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「熱負載、灰階時序與誤差預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Thermal load, grey-scale timing and error budget\", which statement holds?","options":["微鏡只是一面小鏡子，照明角度可以任意選。","入射光 10 W、吸收 8% 得 0.8 W，加驅動電功率 1.5 W 共 2.3 W。","微鏡是類比連續偏轉的，可以停在任意角度。"],"optionsEn":["A micromirror is just a tiny mirror, so the illumination angle can be anything.","Incident 10 W with 8% absorption gives 0.8 W, plus 1.5 W drive power, 2.3 W in total.","Micromirrors deflect continuously and can be held at any angle."],"answer":1,"explanation":"入射光 10 W、吸收 8% 得 0.8 W，加驅動電功率 1.5 W 共 2.3 W；晶片到底座熱阻 1.2 K/W、底座到環境 8 K/W（風冷）時陣列溫升 ≈ 2.3×9.2 ≈ 21 K，環境 35 °C 下陣列 56 °C，低於 70 °C 的典型上限。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Incident 10 W with 8% absorption gives 0.8 W, plus 1.5 W drive power, 2.3 W in total; with 1.2 K/W die-to-base and 8 K/W base-to-ambient (forced air) the array rises ≈ 2.3×9.2 ≈ 21 K, reaching 56 °C at 35 °C ambient, below the typical 70 °C limit. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a420-v12-23","title":"熱負載、灰階時序與誤差預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Thermal load, grey-scale timing and error budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「DMD 陣列溫度與熱阻模型」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “DMD array temperature and thermal-resistance model” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以元件內建溫度感測或貼附熱電偶記錄陣列溫度對入射功率的斜率，與熱阻模型比較；用光電二極體量 0 到 255 灰階的時間平均光強，畫出電光轉換曲線並以最小平方擬合伽瑪，殘差超過 1 個灰階即需調整時槽補償表。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Log array temperature against incident power with the device's temperature sensor or an attached thermocouple and compare the slope with the thermal-resistance model; measure the time-averaged intensity for grey levels 0 to 255 with a photodiode, fit the electro-optical curve to a gamma by least squares, and adjust the slot-compensation table if residuals exceed one grey level. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為 3D 列印把 405 nm 光源加到 20 W 卻未改散熱，陣列溫度超過 70 °C，鏡面切換時間延長，固化圖樣邊緣變軟且數千小時後出現大量黏附像素。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Raising a 405 nm source to 20 W for 3D printing without changing the cooling pushes the array past 70 °C; switching slows, cured pattern edges soften and after a few thousand hours many pixels stick.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以元件內建溫度感測或貼附熱電偶記錄陣列溫度對入射功率的斜率，與熱阻模型比較；用光電二極體量 0 到 255 灰階的時間平均光強，畫出電光轉換曲線並以最小平方擬合伽瑪，殘差超過 1 個灰階即需調整時槽補償表。","textEn":"Log array temperature against incident power with the device's temperature sensor or an attached thermocouple and compare the slope with the thermal-resistance model; measure the time-averaged intensity for grey levels 0 to 255 with a photodiode, fit the electro-optical curve to a gamma by least squares, and adjust the slot-compensation table if residuals exceed one grey level.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「熱負載、灰階時序與誤差預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Thermal load, grey-scale timing and error budget\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","積分柱越長均勻度越好，所以長度沒有代價。","以元件內建溫度感測或貼附熱電偶記錄陣列溫度對入射功率的斜率，與熱阻模型比較。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","A longer integrator rod always improves uniformity, so length has no cost.","Log array temperature against incident power with the device's temperature sensor or an attached thermocouple and compare the slope with the thermal-resistance model."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以元件內建溫度感測或貼附熱電偶記錄陣列溫度對入射功率的斜率，與熱阻模型比較；用光電二極體量 0 到 255 灰階的時間平均光強，畫出電光轉換曲線並以最小平方擬合伽瑪，殘差超過 1 個灰階即需調整時槽補償表。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Log array temperature against incident power with the device's temperature sensor or an attached thermocouple and compare the slope with the thermal-resistance model; measure the time-averaged intensity for grey levels 0 to 255 with a photodiode, fit the electro-optical curve to a gamma by least squares, and adjust the slot-compensation table if residuals exceed one grey level. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a420-v12-24","title":"熱負載、灰階時序與誤差預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Thermal load, grey-scale timing and error budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「DMD 陣列溫度與熱阻模型」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “DMD array temperature and thermal-resistance model” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為 3D 列印把 405 nm 光源加到 20 W 卻未改散熱，陣列溫度超過 70 °C，鏡面切換時間延長，固化圖樣邊緣變軟且數千小時後出現大量黏附像素。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Raising a 405 nm source to 20 W for 3D printing without changing the cooling pushes the array past 70 °C; switching slows, cured pattern edges soften and after a few thousand hours many pixels stick. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：各項以均方根合成，再決定是否加散熱、降圖樣率或改用寬頻光源。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The items are root-sum-squared before deciding on more cooling, a lower pattern rate or a broadband source.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「鏡面是反射的，所以 DMD 不會吸收光功率、不需要散熱。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Mirrors reflect, so a DMD absorbs no optical power and needs no cooling.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為 3D 列印把 405 nm 光源加到 20 W 卻未改散熱，陣列溫度超過 70 °C，鏡面切換時間延長，固化圖樣邊緣變軟且數千小時後出現大量黏附像素。","textEn":"Raising a 405 nm source to 20 W for 3D printing without changing the cooling pushes the array past 70 °C; switching slows, cured pattern edges soften and after a few thousand hours many pixels stick.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「熱負載、灰階時序與誤差預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Thermal load, grey-scale timing and error budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["為 3D 列印把 405 nm 光源加到 20 W 卻未改散熱，陣列溫度超過 70 °C，鏡面切換時間延長，固化圖樣邊緣變軟且數千小時後出現大量黏附像素。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","投影像素尺寸只由 DMD 像素間距決定。"],"optionsEn":["Raising a 405 nm source to 20 W for 3D printing without changing the cooling pushes the array past 70 °C.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","The projected pixel size is set by the DMD pitch alone."],"answer":0,"explanation":"為 3D 列印把 405 nm 光源加到 20 W 卻未改散熱，陣列溫度超過 70 °C，鏡面切換時間延長，固化圖樣邊緣變軟且數千小時後出現大量黏附像素。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Raising a 405 nm source to 20 W for 3D printing without changing the cooling pushes the array past 70 °C; switching slows, cured pattern edges soften and after a few thousand hours many pixels stick. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a420-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「圖樣投射系統整合：解析度與景深」與「均勻度驗收與工程交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Pattern-projection integration: resolution and depth of field\" and \"Uniformity acceptance and engineering handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a420-v12-25","title":"圖樣投射系統整合：解析度與景深：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Pattern-projection integration: resolution and depth of field: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「投影鏡頭倍率與成像面像素」如何決定數位微鏡光學引擎的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Projection magnification and image-plane pixel” determines the key performance of “Digital-micromirror optical engines”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"把引擎整合進 3D 列印、無光罩微影或結構光量測時，投影鏡頭的倍率決定像面的像素尺寸，而像方數值孔徑等於物方數值孔徑除以倍率，繞射光斑與景深都由它決定。DMD 側的 f/2.4 對應物方 NA 0.208；倍率越大像面像素越大、NA 越小、景深越深，解析度則由像素與繞射光斑中較大者決定。設計時要讓繞射光斑小於像素，又讓景深涵蓋平台的平面度與樹脂液面的起伏。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「投影鏡頭倍率與成像面像素」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"When the engine is integrated into 3D printing, maskless lithography or structured-light measurement, the projection magnification sets the pixel size at the image plane, and the image-side numerical aperture equals the object-side value divided by magnification, which in turn fixes the diffraction spot and depth of field. The f/2.4 at the DMD corresponds to an object-side NA of 0.208; larger magnification gives larger image pixels, smaller NA and deeper focus, with resolution set by the larger of pixel and diffraction spot. The design must keep the spot smaller than the pixel while the depth of field covers the platform flatness and resin-surface variation. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Projection magnification and image-plane pixel”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：目標像素 50 µm：M = 50/7.56 ≈ 6.6，像方 NA = 0.208/6.6 ≈ 0.0315；405 nm 的繞射光斑 1.22λ/NA = 1.22×0.405/0.0315 ≈ 15.7 µm，小於像素；景深 ±λ/(2NA²) = ±0.405/(2×0.00099) ≈ ±204 µm，可涵蓋 ±0.1 mm 的平台平面度；成像面尺寸 14.5×6.6 ≈ 96 mm 寬。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For a 50 µm target pixel, M = 50/7.56 ≈ 6.6 and image-side NA = 0.208/6.6 ≈ 0.0315; the 405 nm diffraction spot 1.22λ/NA = 1.22×0.405/0.0315 ≈ 15.7 µm is smaller than the pixel; the depth of field ±λ/(2NA²) = ±0.405/(2×0.00099) ≈ ±204 µm covers a ±0.1 mm platform flatness; the image field is 14.5×6.6 ≈ 96 mm wide.","failure":"常見誤解：「投影像素尺寸只由 DMD 像素間距決定。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The projected pixel size is set by the DMD pitch alone.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「投影鏡頭倍率與成像面像素」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Projection magnification and image-plane pixel”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-25-k1","title":"圖樣投射系統整合：解析度與景深","titleEn":"Pattern-projection integration: resolution and depth of field","text":"把引擎整合進 3D 列印、無光罩微影或結構光量測時，投影鏡頭的倍率決定像面的像素尺寸，而像方數值孔徑等於物方數值孔徑除以倍率，繞射光斑與景深都由它決定。DMD 側的 f/2.4 對應物方 NA 0.208；倍率越大像面像素越大、NA 越小、景深越深，解析度則由像素與繞射光斑中較大者決定。","textEn":"When the engine is integrated into 3D printing, maskless lithography or structured-light measurement, the projection magnification sets the pixel size at the image plane, and the image-side numerical aperture equals the object-side value divided by magnification, which in turn fixes the diffraction spot and depth of field. The f/2.4 at the DMD corresponds to an object-side NA of 0.208; larger magnification gives larger image pixels, smaller NA and deeper focus, with resolution set by the larger of pixel and diffraction spot.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：投影像素尺寸只由 DMD 像素間距決定。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The projected pixel size is set by the DMD pitch alone. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「圖樣投射系統整合：解析度與景深」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pattern-projection integration: resolution and depth of field\" is correct?","options":["投影像素尺寸只由 DMD 像素間距決定。","把引擎整合進 3D 列印、無光罩微影或結構光量測時，投影鏡頭的倍率決定像面的像素尺寸，而像方數值孔徑等於物方數值孔徑除以倍率，繞射光斑與景深都由它決定。","顯示用的均勻度規格對任何應用都足夠。"],"optionsEn":["The projected pixel size is set by the DMD pitch alone.","When the engine is integrated into 3D printing, maskless lithography or structured-light measurement, the projection magnification sets the pixel size at the image plane, and the image-side numerical aperture equals the object-side value divided by magnification, which in turn fixes the diffraction spot and depth of field.","A display-grade uniformity specification is enough for any application."],"answer":1,"explanation":"把引擎整合進 3D 列印、無光罩微影或結構光量測時，投影鏡頭的倍率決定像面的像素尺寸，而像方數值孔徑等於物方數值孔徑除以倍率，繞射光斑與景深都由它決定。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"When the engine is integrated into 3D printing, maskless lithography or structured-light measurement, the projection magnification sets the pixel size at the image plane, and the image-side numerical aperture equals the object-side value divided by magnification, which in turn fixes the diffraction spot and depth of field. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a420-v12-26","title":"圖樣投射系統整合：解析度與景深：定量估算","titleEn":"Pattern-projection integration: resolution and depth of field: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「投影鏡頭倍率與成像面像素」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Projection magnification and image-plane pixel” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：目標像素 50 µm：M = 50/7.56 ≈ 6.6，像方 NA = 0.208/6.6 ≈ 0.0315；405 nm 的繞射光斑 1.22λ/NA = 1.22×0.405/0.0315 ≈ 15.7 µm，小於像素；景深 ±λ/(2NA²) = ±0.405/(2×0.00099) ≈ ±204 µm，可涵蓋 ±0.1 mm 的平台平面度；成像面尺寸 14.5×6.6 ≈ 96 mm 寬。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For a 50 µm target pixel, M = 50/7.56 ≈ 6.6 and image-side NA = 0.208/6.6 ≈ 0.0315; the 405 nm diffraction spot 1.22λ/NA = 1.22×0.405/0.0315 ≈ 15.7 µm is smaller than the pixel; the depth of field ±λ/(2NA²) = ±0.405/(2×0.00099) ≈ ±204 µm covers a ±0.1 mm platform flatness; the image field is 14.5×6.6 ≈ 96 mm wide. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：投射單像素線對與 2、4、8 像素週期的光柵到像面，用顯微鏡相機量線寬與調制度得到 MTF；以 50 µm 步進移動像面量 MTF 對離焦曲線，確認 ±200 µm 內 2 像素週期的對比仍高於 50%。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Project single-pixel line pairs and gratings of 2, 4 and 8 pixel periods onto the image plane, measure line width and modulation with a microscope camera to obtain MTF; step the image plane in 50 µm increments to get MTF versus defocus and confirm that two-pixel-period contrast stays above 50% within ±200 µm.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"目標像素 50 µm：M = 50/7.56 ≈ 6.6，像方 NA = 0.208/6.6 ≈ 0.0315；405 nm 的繞射光斑 1.22λ/NA = 1.22×0.405/0.0315 ≈ 15.7 µm，小於像素；景深 ±λ/(2NA²) = ±0.405/(2×0.00099) ≈ ±204 µm，可涵蓋 ±0.1 mm 的平台平面度；成像面尺寸 14.5×6.6 ≈ 96 mm 寬。","textEn":"For a 50 µm target pixel, M = 50/7.56 ≈ 6.6 and image-side NA = 0.208/6.6 ≈ 0.0315; the 405 nm diffraction spot 1.22λ/NA = 1.22×0.405/0.0315 ≈ 15.7 µm is smaller than the pixel; the depth of field ±λ/(2NA²) = ±0.405/(2×0.00099) ≈ ±204 µm covers a ±0.1 mm platform flatness; the image field is 14.5×6.6 ≈ 96 mm wide.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「圖樣投射系統整合：解析度與景深」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pattern-projection integration: resolution and depth of field\", which statement holds?","options":["光源功率越大，投影亮度一定越高。","積分柱越長均勻度越好，所以長度沒有代價。","目標像素 50 µm：M = 50/7.56 ≈ 6.6，像方 NA = 0.208/6.6 ≈ 0.0315。"],"optionsEn":["Higher source power always gives a brighter projection.","A longer integrator rod always improves uniformity, so length has no cost.","For a 50 µm target pixel, M = 50/7.56 ≈ 6.6 and image-side NA = 0.208/6.6 ≈ 0.0315."],"answer":2,"explanation":"目標像素 50 µm：M = 50/7.56 ≈ 6.6，像方 NA = 0.208/6.6 ≈ 0.0315；405 nm 的繞射光斑 1.22λ/NA = 1.22×0.405/0.0315 ≈ 15.7 µm，小於像素；景深 ±λ/(2NA²) = ±0.405/(2×0.00099) ≈ ±204 µm，可涵蓋 ±0.1 mm 的平台平面度；成像面尺寸 14.5×6.6 ≈ 96 mm 寬。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For a 50 µm target pixel, M = 50/7.56 ≈ 6.6 and image-side NA = 0.208/6.6 ≈ 0.0315; the 405 nm diffraction spot 1.22λ/NA = 1.22×0.405/0.0315 ≈ 15.7 µm is smaller than the pixel; the depth of field ±λ/(2NA²) = ±0.405/(2×0.00099) ≈ ±204 µm covers a ±0.1 mm platform flatness; the image field is 14.5×6.6 ≈ 96 mm wide. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a420-v12-27","title":"圖樣投射系統整合：解析度與景深：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Pattern-projection integration: resolution and depth of field: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「投影鏡頭倍率與成像面像素」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Projection magnification and image-plane pixel” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"投射單像素線對與 2、4、8 像素週期的光柵到像面，用顯微鏡相機量線寬與調制度得到 MTF；以 50 µm 步進移動像面量 MTF 對離焦曲線，確認 ±200 µm 內 2 像素週期的對比仍高於 50%。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Project single-pixel line pairs and gratings of 2, 4 and 8 pixel periods onto the image plane, measure line width and modulation with a microscope camera to obtain MTF; step the image plane in 50 µm increments to get MTF versus defocus and confirm that two-pixel-period contrast stays above 50% within ±200 µm. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：為了放大列印面積把倍率拉到 20，像素 150 µm 看似可接受，但投影鏡頭的畸變在邊角達 0.3%，相當於 3 個像素的位置誤差，列印件在邊角尺寸超差卻在中央合格。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Raising magnification to 20 for a larger build area gives 150 µm pixels that look acceptable, but 0.3% lens distortion at the corners equals a three-pixel position error; printed parts are out of tolerance at the corners while passing at the centre.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"投射單像素線對與 2、4、8 像素週期的光柵到像面，用顯微鏡相機量線寬與調制度得到 MTF；以 50 µm 步進移動像面量 MTF 對離焦曲線，確認 ±200 µm 內 2 像素週期的對比仍高於 50%。","textEn":"Project single-pixel line pairs and gratings of 2, 4 and 8 pixel periods onto the image plane, measure line width and modulation with a microscope camera to obtain MTF; step the image plane in 50 µm increments to get MTF versus defocus and confirm that two-pixel-period contrast stays above 50% within ±200 µm.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「圖樣投射系統整合：解析度與景深」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pattern-projection integration: resolution and depth of field\"?","options":["投射單像素線對與 2、4、8 像素週期的光柵到像面，用顯微鏡相機量線寬與調制度得到 MTF。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","流明是光源的屬性，與引擎的 f 數無關。"],"optionsEn":["Project single-pixel line pairs and gratings of 2, 4 and 8 pixel periods onto the image plane, measure line width and modulation with a microscope camera to obtain MTF.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Lumens are a property of the light source, independent of the engine f-number."],"answer":0,"explanation":"投射單像素線對與 2、4、8 像素週期的光柵到像面，用顯微鏡相機量線寬與調制度得到 MTF；以 50 µm 步進移動像面量 MTF 對離焦曲線，確認 ±200 µm 內 2 像素週期的對比仍高於 50%。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Project single-pixel line pairs and gratings of 2, 4 and 8 pixel periods onto the image plane, measure line width and modulation with a microscope camera to obtain MTF; step the image plane in 50 µm increments to get MTF versus defocus and confirm that two-pixel-period contrast stays above 50% within ±200 µm. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a420-v12-28","title":"圖樣投射系統整合：解析度與景深：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pattern-projection integration: resolution and depth of field: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「投影鏡頭倍率與成像面像素」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Projection magnification and image-plane pixel” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"為了放大列印面積把倍率拉到 20，像素 150 µm 看似可接受，但投影鏡頭的畸變在邊角達 0.3%，相當於 3 個像素的位置誤差，列印件在邊角尺寸超差卻在中央合格。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Raising magnification to 20 for a larger build area gives 150 µm pixels that look acceptable, but 0.3% lens distortion at the corners equals a three-pixel position error; printed parts are out of tolerance at the corners while passing at the centre. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：設計時要讓繞射光斑小於像素，又讓景深涵蓋平台的平面度與樹脂液面的起伏。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The design must keep the spot smaller than the pixel while the depth of field covers the platform flatness and resin-surface variation.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「投影像素尺寸只由 DMD 像素間距決定。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The projected pixel size is set by the DMD pitch alone.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"為了放大列印面積把倍率拉到 20，像素 150 µm 看似可接受，但投影鏡頭的畸變在邊角達 0.3%，相當於 3 個像素的位置誤差，列印件在邊角尺寸超差卻在中央合格。","textEn":"Raising magnification to 20 for a larger build area gives 150 µm pixels that look acceptable, but 0.3% lens distortion at the corners equals a three-pixel position error; printed parts are out of tolerance at the corners while passing at the centre.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「圖樣投射系統整合：解析度與景深」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pattern-projection integration: resolution and depth of field\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","為了放大列印面積把倍率拉到 20，像素 150 µm 看似可接受，但投影鏡頭的畸變在邊角達 0.3%，相當於 3 個像素的位置誤差，列印件在邊角尺寸超差卻在中央合格。","顯示用的均勻度規格對任何應用都足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Raising magnification to 20 for a larger build area gives 150 µm pixels that look acceptable, but 0.3% lens distortion at the corners equals a three-pixel position error.","A display-grade uniformity specification is enough for any application."],"answer":1,"explanation":"為了放大列印面積把倍率拉到 20，像素 150 µm 看似可接受，但投影鏡頭的畸變在邊角達 0.3%，相當於 3 個像素的位置誤差，列印件在邊角尺寸超差卻在中央合格。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Raising magnification to 20 for a larger build area gives 150 µm pixels that look acceptable, but 0.3% lens distortion at the corners equals a three-pixel position error; printed parts are out of tolerance at the corners while passing at the centre. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a420-v12-29","title":"均勻度驗收與工程交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Uniformity acceptance and engineering handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「均勻度地圖、固化深度與驗收報告」如何決定數位微鏡光學引擎的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Uniformity map, cure depth and acceptance report” determines the key performance of “Digital-micromirror optical engines”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"交接文件把引擎的光學規格與下游製程的敏感度連起來。對投影顯示，9 點均勻度與色彩不均勻以 ANSI 方法報告；對光固化列印，像面照度均勻度直接透過 Jacobs 固化深度關係 C_d = D_p·ln(E/E_c) 轉成層厚誤差，因此均勻度規格必須從列印公差反推。報告需附亮度鏈表、對比、均勻度地圖、畸變圖、灰階曲線、熱與壽命數據，以及控制器韌體與時槽補償表的版本。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「均勻度地圖、固化深度與驗收報告」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The handoff document ties the engine's optical specifications to the sensitivity of the downstream process. For projection displays, 9-point uniformity and colour non-uniformity are reported by the ANSI method; for photopolymer printing, image-plane irradiance uniformity converts directly into layer-thickness error through the Jacobs cure-depth relation C_d = D_p·ln(E/E_c), so the uniformity specification must be derived backward from the print tolerance. The report carries the flux-chain table, contrast, uniformity map, distortion map, grey-scale curve, thermal and lifetime data, and the versions of controller firmware and slot-compensation tables. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Uniformity map, cure depth and acceptance report”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：樹脂穿透深度 D_p = 100 µm、額定曝光量 E = 4E_c 時 C_d = 100×ln4 ≈ 139 µm；若照度高 10%，C_d = 100×ln4.4 ≈ 148 µm，多固化 9.5 µm；要把層厚誤差壓在 ±5 µm，像面照度均勻度須優於 ±5%。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: With resin penetration depth D_p = 100 µm and rated exposure E = 4E_c, C_d = 100×ln4 ≈ 139 µm; a 10% higher irradiance gives C_d = 100×ln4.4 ≈ 148 µm, 9.5 µm of over-cure; holding layer error to ±5 µm requires image-plane irradiance uniformity better than ±5%.","failure":"常見誤解：「顯示用的均勻度規格對任何應用都足夠。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A display-grade uniformity specification is enough for any application.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「均勻度地圖、固化深度與驗收報告」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Uniformity map, cure depth and acceptance report”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-29-k1","title":"均勻度驗收與工程交接","titleEn":"Uniformity acceptance and engineering handoff","text":"交接文件把引擎的光學規格與下游製程的敏感度連起來。對投影顯示，9 點均勻度與色彩不均勻以 ANSI 方法報告；對光固化列印，像面照度均勻度直接透過 Jacobs 固化深度關係 C_d = D_p·ln(E/E_c) 轉成層厚誤差，因此均勻度規格必須從列印公差反推。","textEn":"The handoff document ties the engine's optical specifications to the sensitivity of the downstream process. For projection displays, 9-point uniformity and colour non-uniformity are reported by the ANSI method; for photopolymer printing, image-plane irradiance uniformity converts directly into layer-thickness error through the Jacobs cure-depth relation C_d = D_p·ln(E/E_c), so the uniformity specification must be derived backward from the print tolerance.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：顯示用的均勻度規格對任何應用都足夠。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A display-grade uniformity specification is enough for any application. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「均勻度驗收與工程交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Uniformity acceptance and engineering handoff\" is correct?","options":["顯示用的均勻度規格對任何應用都足夠。","微鏡只是一面小鏡子，照明角度可以任意選。","交接文件把引擎的光學規格與下游製程的敏感度連起來。"],"optionsEn":["A display-grade uniformity specification is enough for any application.","A micromirror is just a tiny mirror, so the illumination angle can be anything.","The handoff document ties the engine's optical specifications to the sensitivity of the downstream process."],"answer":2,"explanation":"交接文件把引擎的光學規格與下游製程的敏感度連起來。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The handoff document ties the engine's optical specifications to the sensitivity of the downstream process. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a420-v12-30","title":"均勻度驗收與工程交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Uniformity acceptance and engineering handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「均勻度地圖、固化深度與驗收報告」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Uniformity map, cure depth and acceptance report” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：樹脂穿透深度 D_p = 100 µm、額定曝光量 E = 4E_c 時 C_d = 100×ln4 ≈ 139 µm；若照度高 10%，C_d = 100×ln4.4 ≈ 148 µm，多固化 9.5 µm；要把層厚誤差壓在 ±5 µm，像面照度均勻度須優於 ±5%。ANSI 9 點均勻度驗收門檻取 85%。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: With resin penetration depth D_p = 100 µm and rated exposure E = 4E_c, C_d = 100×ln4 ≈ 139 µm; a 10% higher irradiance gives C_d = 100×ln4.4 ≈ 148 µm, 9.5 µm of over-cure; holding layer error to ±5 µm requires image-plane irradiance uniformity better than ±5%. The 9-point ANSI uniformity acceptance threshold is set at 85%. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：用校正過的 405 nm 輻照度計在像面以 10 mm 網格量 100 點並繪均勻度地圖；列印一片測試層，以厚度計量各位置的固化厚度並與 Jacobs 關係預測比較；所有量測結果、韌體版本與補償表雜湊值一併寫入驗收報告。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure 100 points on a 10 mm grid at the image plane with a calibrated 405 nm irradiance meter and draw the uniformity map; print a test layer, measure cured thickness at each position with a thickness gauge and compare with the Jacobs prediction; write all results with firmware versions and compensation-table hashes into the acceptance report.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"樹脂穿透深度 D_p = 100 µm、額定曝光量 E = 4E_c 時 C_d = 100×ln4 ≈ 139 µm；若照度高 10%，C_d = 100×ln4.4 ≈ 148 µm，多固化 9.5 µm；要把層厚誤差壓在 ±5 µm，像面照度均勻度須優於 ±5%。ANSI 9 點均勻度驗收門檻取 85%。","textEn":"With resin penetration depth D_p = 100 µm and rated exposure E = 4E_c, C_d = 100×ln4 ≈ 139 µm; a 10% higher irradiance gives C_d = 100×ln4.4 ≈ 148 µm, 9.5 µm of over-cure; holding layer error to ±5 µm requires image-plane irradiance uniformity better than ±5%. The 9-point ANSI uniformity acceptance threshold is set at 85%.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「均勻度驗收與工程交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Uniformity acceptance and engineering handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["樹脂穿透深度 D_p = 100 µm、額定曝光量 E = 4E_c 時 C_d = 100×ln4 ≈ 139 µm。","微鏡是類比連續偏轉的，可以停在任意角度。","流明是光源的屬性，與引擎的 f 數無關。"],"optionsEn":["With resin penetration depth D_p = 100 µm and rated exposure E = 4E_c, C_d = 100×ln4 ≈ 139 µm.","Micromirrors deflect continuously and can be held at any angle.","Lumens are a property of the light source, independent of the engine f-number."],"answer":0,"explanation":"樹脂穿透深度 D_p = 100 µm、額定曝光量 E = 4E_c 時 C_d = 100×ln4 ≈ 139 µm；若照度高 10%，C_d = 100×ln4.4 ≈ 148 µm，多固化 9.5 µm；要把層厚誤差壓在 ±5 µm，像面照度均勻度須優於 ±5%。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"With resin penetration depth D_p = 100 µm and rated exposure E = 4E_c, C_d = 100×ln4 ≈ 139 µm; a 10% higher irradiance gives C_d = 100×ln4.4 ≈ 148 µm, 9.5 µm of over-cure; holding layer error to ±5 µm requires image-plane irradiance uniformity better than ±5%. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a420-v12-31","title":"均勻度驗收與工程交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Uniformity acceptance and engineering handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「均勻度地圖、固化深度與驗收報告」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Uniformity map, cure depth and acceptance report” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"用校正過的 405 nm 輻照度計在像面以 10 mm 網格量 100 點並繪均勻度地圖；列印一片測試層，以厚度計量各位置的固化厚度並與 Jacobs 關係預測比較；所有量測結果、韌體版本與補償表雜湊值一併寫入驗收報告。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure 100 points on a 10 mm grid at the image plane with a calibrated 405 nm irradiance meter and draw the uniformity map; print a test layer, measure cured thickness at each position with a thickness gauge and compare with the Jacobs prediction; write all results with firmware versions and compensation-table hashes into the acceptance report. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：引擎以顯示規格「均勻度 80%」交付給列印機，邊角照度比中心低 20%，固化深度差 22 µm，列印件在邊角分層；因為交接文件沒有照度地圖，列印端花數週才找出是光學引擎而非樹脂問題。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: An engine delivered to a printer under a display specification of 80% uniformity has corners 20% darker than the centre, a 22 µm cure-depth difference and delamination at the corners; with no irradiance map in the handoff, the printing team spends weeks before tracing the fault to the engine rather than the resin.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"用校正過的 405 nm 輻照度計在像面以 10 mm 網格量 100 點並繪均勻度地圖；列印一片測試層，以厚度計量各位置的固化厚度並與 Jacobs 關係預測比較；所有量測結果、韌體版本與補償表雜湊值一併寫入驗收報告。","textEn":"Measure 100 points on a 10 mm grid at the image plane with a calibrated 405 nm irradiance meter and draw the uniformity map; print a test layer, measure cured thickness at each position with a thickness gauge and compare with the Jacobs prediction; write all results with firmware versions and compensation-table hashes into the acceptance report.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「均勻度驗收與工程交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Uniformity acceptance and engineering handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","用校正過的 405 nm 輻照度計在像面以 10 mm 網格量 100 點並繪均勻度地圖。","鏡面是反射的，所以 DMD 不會吸收光功率、不需要散熱。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Measure 100 points on a 10 mm grid at the image plane with a calibrated 405 nm irradiance meter and draw the uniformity map.","Mirrors reflect, so a DMD absorbs no optical power and needs no cooling."],"answer":1,"explanation":"用校正過的 405 nm 輻照度計在像面以 10 mm 網格量 100 點並繪均勻度地圖；列印一片測試層，以厚度計量各位置的固化厚度並與 Jacobs 關係預測比較；所有量測結果、韌體版本與補償表雜湊值一併寫入驗收報告。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure 100 points on a 10 mm grid at the image plane with a calibrated 405 nm irradiance meter and draw the uniformity map; print a test layer, measure cured thickness at each position with a thickness gauge and compare with the Jacobs prediction; write all results with firmware versions and compensation-table hashes into the acceptance report. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a420-v12-32","title":"均勻度驗收與工程交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Uniformity acceptance and engineering handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"prerequisiteIds":["a420-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「均勻度地圖、固化深度與驗收報告」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Uniformity map, cure depth and acceptance report” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"引擎以顯示規格「均勻度 80%」交付給列印機，邊角照度比中心低 20%，固化深度差 22 µm，列印件在邊角分層；因為交接文件沒有照度地圖，列印端花數週才找出是光學引擎而非樹脂問題。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"An engine delivered to a printer under a display specification of 80% uniformity has corners 20% darker than the centre, a 22 µm cure-depth difference and delamination at the corners; with no irradiance map in the handoff, the printing team spends weeks before tracing the fault to the engine rather than the resin. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：報告需附亮度鏈表、對比、均勻度地圖、畸變圖、灰階曲線、熱與壽命數據，以及控制器韌體與時槽補償表的版本。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The report carries the flux-chain table, contrast, uniformity map, distortion map, grey-scale curve, thermal and lifetime data, and the versions of controller firmware and slot-compensation tables.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「顯示用的均勻度規格對任何應用都足夠。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A display-grade uniformity specification is enough for any application.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a420-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"引擎以顯示規格「均勻度 80%」交付給列印機，邊角照度比中心低 20%，固化深度差 22 µm，列印件在邊角分層；因為交接文件沒有照度地圖，列印端花數週才找出是光學引擎而非樹脂問題。","textEn":"An engine delivered to a printer under a display specification of 80% uniformity has corners 20% darker than the centre, a 22 µm cure-depth difference and delamination at the corners; with no irradiance map in the handoff, the printing team spends weeks before tracing the fault to the engine rather than the resin.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]},{"id":"a420-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「均勻度驗收與工程交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Uniformity acceptance and engineering handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","微鏡只是一面小鏡子，照明角度可以任意選。","引擎以顯示規格「均勻度 80%」交付給列印機，邊角照度比中心低 20%，固化深度差 22 µm，列印件在邊角分層。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","A micromirror is just a tiny mirror, so the illumination angle can be anything.","An engine delivered to a printer under a display specification of 80% uniformity has corners 20% darker than the centre, a 22 µm cure-depth difference and delamination at the corners."],"answer":2,"explanation":"引擎以顯示規格「均勻度 80%」交付給列印機，邊角照度比中心低 20%，固化深度差 22 µm，列印件在邊角分層；因為交接文件沒有照度地圖，列印端花數週才找出是光學引擎而非樹脂問題。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"An engine delivered to a printer under a display specification of 80% uniformity has corners 20% darker than the centre, a 22 µm cure-depth difference and delamination at the corners; with no irradiance map in the handoff, the printing team spends weeks before tracing the fault to the engine rather than the resin. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-ti-dlp-overview","v12o-ti-dlp6500flq","v12o-vialux-dmd-modules"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
